hewy.com%252Ffrisco-quilted-water-resistant-bench%252Fdp%252F170833%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrisco%20Quilted%20Water-Resistant%20Bench%20Car%20Seat%20Cover%3C%2Fa%3E%20earned%20the%20top%20spot%20because%20it%20solved%20my%20biggest%20frustration%3A%20fur%20and%20dirt%20collecting%20on%20my%20seats%20and%20in%20the%20footwells.%20Unlike%20smooth%20covers%20that%20let%20debris%20slide%20around%2C%20this%20cover's%20quilted%20channels%20catch%20fur%2C%20dirt%2C%20tiny%20pebbles%2C%20and%20grass%20before%20they%20reach%20my%20leather%20upholstery%20or%20the%20floor%20of%20my%20car.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20woven%20polyester%20fabric%20was%20soft%20yet%20durable%20enough%20to%20handle%20Lyla's%20biggest%20messes%2C%20from%20muddy%20paws%20and%20dripping%20wet%20fur%20after%20swimming%20to%20her%20heavy%20shedding.%20When%20it%20was%20time%20to%20clean%2C%20I%20simply%20wiped%20away%20unwanted%20dirt%20and%20hair%20with%20a%20damp%20rag.%20Because%20the%20fabric%20is%20tightly%20woven%2C%20fur%20didn't%20get%20caught%20in%20the%20fibers%2C%20so%20I%20barely%20needed%20to%20use%20my%20lint%20roller%20to%20remove%20stubborn%20hairs.%20After%20machine%20washing%20and%20air-drying%20the%20cover%2C%20it%20looked%20nearly%20new.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20side-by-side%20image%20of%20a%20dog%20sitting%20on%20a%20quilted%20car%20seat%2C%20over%20beside%20a%20close-up%20of%20the%20same%20cover%20with%20water%20beading%20on%20top.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a64f5f7ce52cb26b8393fa8%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20bench%20cover%20is%20ideal%20for%20everyday%20use%20and%20includes%20waterproof%20protection.%3Cp%3ESophia%20Carlisle%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EInstallation%20was%20a%20breeze%2C%20too.%20I%20looped%20the%20adjustable%20straps%20over%20the%20headrests%20and%20tucked%20the%20seat%20anchors%20into%20the%20crease%20between%20the%20seat%20back%20and%20cushion.%20The%20anchors%2C%20along%20with%20the%20grippy%2C%20nonslip%20backing%2C%20kept%20the%20cover%20in%20place%20while%20I%20drove.%20Even%20when%20my%20four-legged%20hurricane%20jumped%20around%20in%20the%20backseat%2C%20tossing%20her%20stuffed%20toy%20and%20digging%20at%20the%20fabric%20to%20get%20at%20it%2C%20the%20cover%20never%20budged.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20biggest%20complaint%20is%20the%20seat%20belt%20openings.%20They're%20useful%20if%20you%20occasionally%20have%20passengers%2C%20but%20I%20struggled%20to%20thread%20the%20buckles%20through%20the%20slots.%20It's%20also%20designed%20for%20only%20two%20passengers%20so%20there's%20no%20opening%20for%20the%20middle%20seat%20belt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22069f6f2a-59dc-4996-84fd-71e369bf5f79%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20hammock%5C%22%3EBest%20hammock%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EA%20hammock-style%20cover%20does%20more%20than%20protect%20your%20backseat.%20It%20covers%20the%20gap%20between%20the%20front%20and%20rear%20seats%20to%20prevent%20dirt%20and%20debris%20from%20collecting%20in%20the%20footwells%20and%20creates%20a%20barrier%20that%20helps%20keep%20your%20dog%20in%20the%20backseat.%20The%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D5ebf18912b846fdbf1a73ddb9fc501ff4cb656f32ed694a19017ddd4d70d1ec4%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Ffrisco-quilted-water-resistant%252Fdp%252F170837%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrisco%20Quilted%20Water-Resistant%20Hammock%20Car%20Seat%20Cover%3C%2Fa%3E%20did%20both%20of%20those%20things%20well%20in%20my%20testing.%20I%20also%20appreciated%20the%20built-in%20storage%20pockets%2C%20which%20held%20treats%2C%20wipes%2C%20poop%20bags%2C%20a%20travel%20water%20bottle%2C%20and%20even%20an%20emergency%20nail%20clipper%20that%20I%20normally%20store%20in%20my%20back-of-seat%20pockets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20tested%20the%20regular-size%20cover%20with%20Lyla%2C%20and%20it%20fit%20my%20compact%20SUV%20well.%20Senior%20pets%20editor%20Lisa%20Sabatini%20also%20has%20this%20cover%20installed%20in%20a%20mid-size%20sedan%2C%20and%20it's%20an%20excellent%20size.%20Installation%20was%20straightforward%3A%20I%20looped%20the%20adjustable%20straps%20over%20the%20front%20and%20rear%20headrests%20and%20pushed%20the%20seat%20anchors%20into%20the%20crease%20of%20the%20backseat.%20Like%20the%20Frisco%20Quilted%20Bench%20Cover%2C%20it%20has%20a%20grippy%2C%20nonslip%20underside%20that%20works%20in%20combination%20with%20the%20seat%20anchors%20to%20prevent%20shifting%20while%20driving.%20During%20one%20ride%2C%20Lyla%20dropped%20a%20pup%20cup%20into%20the%20small%20gap%20between%20the%20seat%20and%20the%20door%20and%20tried%20to%20retrieve%20it%20by%20digging.%20Despite%20her%20attempts%20to%20reach%20it%2C%20the%20cover%20stayed%20firmly%20in%20place.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222500%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20gray%20quilted%20hammock-style%20car%20seat%20cover%20is%20installed%20in%20the%20backseat%20of%20a%20car.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a64f506ce52cb26b8393fa6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221875%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20hammock-style%20cover%20is%20an%20excellent%20fit%20for%20a%20mid-size%20sedan.%3Cp%3ELisa%20Sabatini%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20hammock%20kept%20Lyla%20from%20climbing%20into%20the%20front%20seat%20while%20still%20allowing%20her%20to%20see%20me.%20At%20first%2C%20she%20seemed%20anxious%20about%20the%20barrier%2C%20but%20she%20quickly%20got%20used%20to%20it.%20I%20also%20appreciated%20the%20extra%20protection%20it%20provided%20for%20the%20backs%20of%20my%20front%20seats.%20If%20your%20dog%20rides%20with%20a%20tethered%20harness%2C%20you%20can%20also%20thread%20a%20seatbelt%20through%20the%20openings%20on%20the%20left%20or%20right%20side%2C%20but%20not%20the%20middle%20seat.%20And%20if%20you%20need%20to%20make%20room%20for%20a%20backseat%20passenger%2C%20simply%20remove%20the%20straps%20from%20the%20front%20headrests%20and%20let%20the%20cover%20lie%20flat%20over%20the%20edge%20of%20the%20rear%20seat%20instead%20of%20hanging%20hammock-style.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20hammock%20design%20does%20have%20a%20drawback%3A%20It's%20bulkier%20than%20a%20bench%20cover.%20It%20was%20a%20tighter%20fit%20in%20my%20standard%20washing%20machine%2C%20so%20instead%20of%20washing%20as%20often%20as%20I%20normally%20would%2C%20I%20wiped%20it%20down%20more%20frequently.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22fb3c1968-290a-46b2-af9c-96aec7ca19cf%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Best%20full%20coverage%5C%22%3EBest%20full%20coverage%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOf%20all%20the%20covers%20I%20tested%2C%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Dca66d8697dc6d9eae0c75ba595dbe7dc1533114fb57a37c929ef61f2973ba6d6%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.amazon.com%252FURPOWER-100-Waterproof-Hammock-Scratch-Nonslip%252Fdp%252FB093781XN5%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EURPOWER%20Dog%20Car%20Seat%20Cover%3C%2Fa%3E%20offered%20the%20most%20comprehensive%20protection.%20It%20covered%20the%20entire%20backseat%20of%20my%20vehicle%2C%20including%20the%20seat%20cushions%2C%20the%20backs%20of%20the%20front%20seats%2C%20the%20foot%20wells%2C%20and%20the%20doors.%20The%20zippered%20door%20flaps%20are%20what%20set%20this%20hammock%20cover%20apart%20from%20the%20other%20covers.%20Once%20zipped%20into%20place%2C%20they%20created%20a%20barrier%20between%20Lyla%20and%20the%20door%20panels%2C%20preventing%20muddy%20paws%20from%20rubbing%20against%20the%20doors%20and%20protecting%20the%20armrests%20from%20nail%20scratches.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20the%20end%20of%20my%20two-week%20test%2C%20I%20found%20barely%20a%20tablespoon's%20worth%20of%20debris%20beneath%20the%20cover.%20Even%20after%20Lyla%20climbed%20into%20the%20car%2C%20soaking%20wet%20from%20a%20swim%20in%20the%20lake%2C%20no%20water%20seeped%20through%20to%20my%20seats.%20Since%20her%20thin%20coat%20drips%20so%20much%20water%20after%20a%20swim%2C%20reliable%20waterproofing%20is%20one%20of%20my%20biggest%20priorities%20in%20a%20car%20seat%20cover.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221920%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20side-by-side%20photo%20showing%20a%20black%20hammock-style%20car%20seat%20cover%20and%20the%20same%20cover%20with%20a%20large%20black%20dog%20standing%20inside.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a64f59ace52cb26b8393fa7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221440%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThis%20hammock-style%20cover%20provided%20the%20best%20coverage%2C%20with%20added%20protection%20for%20the%20doors.%3Cp%3ESophia%20Carlisle%2FBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20biggest%20downside%20was%20having%20to%20unzip%20and%20rezip%20the%20door%20flaps%20every%20time%20Lyla%20got%20in%20or%20out%20of%20the%20car.%20I%20found%20the%20zippers%20on%20the%20flaps%20easily%20caught%20on%20the%20track%2C%20so%20it%20took%20some%20maneuvering%20each%20time.%20Once%20the%20flap%20was%20unzipped%2C%20however%2C%20it%20easily%20folded%20down%20and%20extended%20far%20enough%20that%20Lyla's%20dirty%20paws%20never%20touched%20the%20seat%2C%20eliminating%20any%20chance%20of%20transferring%20water%20or%20debris.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20instruction%20pamphlet%20recommends%20wiping%20the%20cover%20with%20a%20damp%20cloth%20or%20vacuuming%20instead%20of%20machine%20washing.%20I%20did%20both%2C%20but%20I%20also%20ran%20it%20through%20a%20normal%20cold-water%20wash%20cycle%20to%20see%20how%20it%20held%20up.%20After%20line-drying%2C%20I%20noticed%20a%20small%20amount%20of%20shrinkage%2C%20but%20the%20cover%20still%20fits%20my%20car%20well.%20I%20also%20found%20a%20few%20scratch%20marks%20from%20Lyla's%20nails%20on%20the%20door%20flaps%20after%20two%20weeks%20of%20testing.%20Despite%20being%20marketed%20as%20scratch-proof%2C%20the%20material%20showed%20some%20wear%20where%20she%20repeatedly%20scratched%2C%20but%20it%20didn't%20affect%20the%20cover's%20waterproofing%20or%20ability%20to%20contain%20dirt.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%221bb569d0-710e-4360-9057-2f5c8c003e53%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22Our%20top%20picks%20compared%5C%22%3EOur%20top%20picks%20compared%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Ccolgroup%3E%3Ccol%3E%3Ccol%3E%3Ccol%3E%3Ccol%3E%3C%2Fcolgroup%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3Dfc12c028f62ee4b5bda658fd451c691fa4d1501cc5cfd3d84fc0c5eefb03fb1b%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Ffrisco-quilted-water-resistant-bench%252Fdp%252F170833%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrisco%20Quilted%20Water-Resistant%20Bench%20Car%20Seat%20Cover%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D5ebf18912b846fdbf1a73ddb9fc501ff4cb656f32ed694a19017ddd4d70d1ec4%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Ffrisco-quilted-water-resistant%252Fdp%252F170837%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrisco%20Quilted%20Water-Resistant%20Hammock%20Car%20Seat%20Cover%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D3f754cf29e1d4633aa8bccc27148cee97afd897476e677da1f5ae6fff7cd7573%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26ta