%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20most%20important%20way%20to%20ensure%20a%20pet's%20safety%20in%20a%20vehicle%20is%20to%20make%20sure%20it%20is%20restrained%2C%26quot%3B%20Teller%20says.%20She%20recommends%20choosing%20a%20car%20seat%20cover%20that%20lets%20you%20secure%20your%20pet%20with%20a%20seat%20belt%20clip%20or%20a%20seat%20belt%20harness%20while%20driving.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETeller%20adds%20that%20while%20car%20seat%20covers%20will%20not%20protect%20a%20pet%20in%20an%20accident%2C%20they%20can%20help%20encourage%20pet%20guardians%20to%20keep%20their%20dogs%20in%20the%20backseat%2C%20where%20they%20are%20at%20lower%20risk%20of%20injury%20in%20common%20accident%20scenarios%20involving%20sudden%20stops%20or%20impacts%20that%20deploy%20front%20airbags.%20%26quot%3BAvoid%20putting%20your%20pet%2C%20even%20if%20harnessed%20or%20in%20a%20crate%2C%20in%20the%20front%20seat%20where%20a%20deployed%20air%20bag%20could%20cause%20injury%20or%20death%20to%20the%20pet%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20says.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20top%20picks%20include%20seat%20belt%20openings%20so%20you%20can%20easily%20attach%20a%20safety%20harness.%20While%20my%20full-coverage%20pick%20from%20URPOWER%20also%20comes%20with%20a%20seatbelt%20attachment%20that%20you%20can%20secure%20around%20your%20dog's%20harness%20with%20a%20carabiner%20clip%2C%20it%20has%20not%20been%20third-party%20crash-tested%20and%20may%20not%20protect%20your%20dog%20in%20a%20crash.%20Instead%2C%20you%20can%20secure%20your%20dog%20with%20a%20Center%20for%20Pet%20Safety-certified%20harness%2C%20such%20as%20the%20%3Ca%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22true%5C%22%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Faffiliate.insider.com%2F%3Fh%3D85084e76184795f6a3edc3eda20c4a73d02963a0fd0259156602e009455ca34f%26postID%3D6a63b8d82efa73b48741949a%26postSlug%3Dguides%252Fpets%252Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%26tags%3Dservice%253Acapi%26u%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.chewy.com%252Fsleepypod-clickit-sport-plus-safety%252Fdp%252F734270%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ESleepypod%20Clickit%20Sport%20Plus%20Harness%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECompatibility%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWatson%20says%20most%20covers%20will%20fit%20your%20car%20as%20long%20as%20you%20check%20the%20measurements%20against%20the%20manufacturer's%20recommendations.%20When%20in%20doubt%2C%20he%20says%20it's%20not%20a%20bad%20idea%20to%20size%20up%20to%20ensure%20more%20extensive%20coverage%20%E2%80%94%20although%20he%20emphasizes%20the%20importance%20of%20ensuring%20seat%20belt%20access%20to%20be%20able%20to%20secure%20your%20pet%20during%20transit%2C%20no%20matter%20the%20cover%20size.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20also%20a%20good%20idea%20to%20look%20for%20covers%20with%20soft%20straps%2C%20reinforced%20stitching%2C%20and%20secure%20but%20nonabrasive%20anchor%20points%20to%20minimize%20damage%20to%20your%20vehicle%20during%20installation%20and%20use%2C%20especially%20if%20you%20have%20leather%20seats.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWatson%20says%20to%20look%20for%20covers%20made%20of%20tightly%20woven%20fabric%20to%20minimize%20the%20risk%20of%20dirt%20and%20fur%20getting%20caught%20in%20the%20fabric%20fibers.%20Tightly%20woven%20material%20will%20allow%20debris%20to%20sit%20on%20top%20of%20the%20fabric%2C%20making%20cleanup%20simple%20with%20a%20quick%20wipe-down%20or%20vacuum.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EEase%20of%20cleaning%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20While%20several%20of%20the%20covers%20I%20tested%20were%20machine%20washable%2C%20others%20recommended%20spot%20cleaning%20or%20vacuuming%20only.%20I%20found%20that%20the%20most%20practical%20covers%20were%20the%20ones%20I%20could%20wipe%20clean%20after%20a%20muddy%20hike%2C%20rather%20than%20immediately%20throwing%20them%20in%20the%20washing%20machine.%20If%20your%20dog%20gets%20dirty%20often%2C%20look%20for%20a%20cover%20with%20a%20tightly%20woven%2C%20water-resistant%20surface%20that%20sheds%20dirt%20and%20fur%20easily%20between%20washes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ELevel%20of%20protection%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EThe%20right%20amount%20of%20coverage%20depends%20on%20how%20much%20dirt%20and%20debris%20your%20pet%20tracks%20in.%20Hammock%20covers%20are%20the%20most%20comprehensive%20backseat%20protection%2C%20stretching%20over%20the%20footwells%20and%20underside%20of%20the%20seats%20to%20block%20hair%20and%20debris.%20Bench%20covers%20can%20still%20provide%20good%20protection%2C%20but%20they%20are%20better%20options%20for%20dogs%20that%20are%20low%20shedders%20and%2For%20who%20don't%20track%20in%20a%20lot%20of%20dirt%20after%20walks.%20Some%20covers%20with%20seatbelt%20openings%20may%20allow%20debris%20through%2C%20even%20if%20the%20cover%20itself%20offers%20overall%20protection.%20To%20prevent%20this%2C%20you%20can%20lay%20a%20towel%20down%20over%20especially%20large%20seatbelt%20gaps.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDog%20comfort%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ELook%20for%20matte%20or%20quilted%20covers%20as%20they%20give%20a%20dog's%20paws%20something%20to%20grip%20when%20the%20car%20is%20in%20motion.%20A%20slippery%20material%20can%20make%20a%20dog%20feel%20unstable%20and%20cause%20them%20to%20slip%20and%20fall%20while%20turning%20or%20braking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22329b678c-f239-4d34-bafd-e4c4af3df011%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22How%20we%20tested%5C%22%3EHow%20we%20tested%20dog%20car%20seat%20covers%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20tested%20nine%20dog%20car%20seat%20covers%20in%20my%202015%20BMW%20X1%20over%20the%20course%20of%20the%20spring%2C%20using%20each%20one%20for%20two%20weeks%20with%20my%2055-pound%20pit%20mix%2C%20Lyla.%20Most%20of%20the%20testing%20took%20place%20as%20part%20of%20our%20normal%20routine%2C%20including%20walks%2C%20hikes%2C%20errands%2C%20and%20trips%20to%20the%20lake.%20I%20also%20performed%20a%20series%20of%20hands-on%20tests%20to%20evaluate%20each%20cover's%20waterproofing%2C%20durability%2C%20stability%2C%20ease%20of%20cleaning%2C%20and%20overall%20protection.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDebris%20collection%20test%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20To%20measure%20how%20well%20each%20cover%20contained%20dirt%20and%20fur%2C%20I%20used%20it%20daily%20with%20Lyla%20for%20five%20days%2C%20then%20collected%20and%20measured%20the%20debris%20left%20on%20top%20of%20the%20cover%2C%20underneath%20it%2C%20and%20in%20the%20footwells.%20I%20compared%20those%20results%20with%20how%20much%20dirt%20accumulated%20in%20my%20car%20over%20the%20same%20period%20without%20a%20seat%20cover%2C%20which%20was%20nearly%20a%20cup%20of%20debris.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWaterproofing%20test%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EI%20poured%20%C2%BC%20cup%20of%20water%20onto%20each%20cover%20and%20checked%20whether%20any%20moisture%20seeped%20through%20to%20my%20leather%20seats.%20I%20also%20observed%20how%20well%20each%20cover%20contained%20the%20water%20instead%20of%20letting%20it%20run%20off%20the%20edges.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EStability%20and%20comfort%20evaluation%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%20Lyla%20likes%20to%20roll%20around%20in%20the%20backseat%20on%20the%20way%20to%20her%20favorite%20walking%20spot%2C%20frequently%20digging%20at%20my%20leather%20seats%20as%20she%20walks%20back%20and%20forth%20along%20them.%20I%20paid%20close%20attention%20to%20whether%20the%20seat%20anchors%20and%20nonslip%20backing%20kept%20each%20cover%20securely%20in%20place%20as%20she%20moved%20around.%20Separately%2C%20I%20also%20took%20a%20fork%20to%20each%20cover%20and%20attempted%20to%20pull%20it%20away%20from%20the%20seat.%20I%20also%20noted%20how%20comfortable%20Lyla%20seemed%20during%20longer%20rides.%20Since%20she%20rarely%20lies%20down%20in%20the%20car%2C%20I%20took%20it%20as%20a%20good%20sign%20when%20she%20settled%20in%20for%20a%20nap.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDurability%20test%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ETo%20simulate%20the%20wear%20caused%20by%20dog%20claws%2C%20I%20dragged%20a%20fork%20across%20each%20cover%2025%20times%20and%20inspected%20the%20fabric%20for%20scratches%20or%20damage.%20I%20also%20tugged%20firmly%20on%20the%20straps%20and%20anchor%20points%20to%20see%20whether%20the%20stitching%20or%20seams%20showed%20signs%20of%20stress.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECleaning%20test%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E%20I%20followed%20each%20manufacturer's%20cleaning%20instructions%2C%20whether%20that%20meant%20machine%20washing%2C%20wiping%20the%20cover%20with%20a%20damp%20cloth%2C%20vacuuming%2C%20or%20hosing%20it%20off.%20For%20covers%20that%20weren't%20machine%20washable%2C%20I%20ran%20them%20through%20a%20normal%20cold-water%20wash%20cycle%20with%20standard%20liquid%20laundry%20detergent%20anyway%20to%20see%20how%20they%20held%20up.%20I%20also%20tested%20how%20easily%20dog%20hair%20could%20be%20removed%20with%20a%20lint%20roller.%20Finally%2C%20I%20compared%20the%20time%20and%20effort%20required%20to%20clean%20each%20cover%20with%20cleaning%20my%20car%20without%20one.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDay-to-day%20ease%20of%20use%3A%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EBecause%20convenience%20matters%20just%20as%20much%20as%20protection%2C%20I%20evaluated%20how%20easy%20each%20cover%20was%20to%20install%2C%20remove%2C%20and%20use%20over%20two%20weeks%20of%20everyday%20driving.%20I%20noted%20how%20well%20each%20one%20worked%20with%20passengers%2C%20how%20easy%20it%20was%20to%20access%20the%20seat%20belts%2C%20and%20whether%20it%20stayed%20securely%20in%20place%20through%20normal%20daily%20use.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2252498c91-bab9-4382-adb3-68e080d14fb2%5C%22%20data-toc-label%3D%5C%22FAQs%5C%22%3EDog%20car%20seat%20cover%20FAQs%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20is%20the%20average%20cost%20of%20a%20good%20dog%20seat%20cover%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EMost%20of%20the%20best%20dog%20car%20seat%20covers%20I%20tested%20cost%20between%20%2450%20and%20%24100.%20You%20can%20find%20options%20for%20less%2C%20but%20they%20typically%20sacrifice%20coverage%2C%20durability%2C%20or%20convenience.%20For%20example%2C%20many%20budget%20covers%20don't%20protect%20the%20footwells%20or%20the%20backs%20of%20the%20front%20seats%20and%20may%20lack%20features%20such%20as%20seat%20anchors%20or%20non-slip%20backing.%20I%20also%20tested%20a%20few%20premium%20covers%20priced%20above%20%24100%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20find%20that%20spending%20more%20necessarily%20resulted%20in%20better%20performance.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWhat%20fabric%20is%20most%20resistant%20to%20dog%20hair%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EOnly%20smooth%2C%20nonwoven%20materials%2C%20such%20as%20leather%20and%20vinyl%2C%20are%20resistant%20to%20pet%20hair.%20Watson%20says%20that%20tightly%20woven%20fabrics%20can%2C%20for%20the%20most%20part%2C%20prevent%20pet%20hair%20from%20getting%20tangled%20in%20the%20fibers.%20The%20best%20way%20to%20keep%20your%20car%20clean%20from%20pet%20hair%20is%20to%20lint%20roll%20and%20vacuum%20often%3B%20that%20way%2C%20you'll%20be%20able%20to%20prevent%20hair%20buildup%2C%20Watson%20says.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch3%3EWill%20a%20car%20seat%20cover%20protect%20my%20leather%20seats%20from%20claw%20punctures%3F%3C%2Fh3%3E%3Cp%3EWatson%20says%20durable%2C%20tightly%20woven%2C%20water-resistant%20materials%20like%20neoprene%2C%20canvas%2C%20and%20heavy-duty%20polyester%20hold%20up%20well%20against%20spills%2C%20a%20dog's%20nails%2C%20and%20everyday%20wear.%20A%20key%20feature%20to%20keep%20an%20eye%20on%20was%20tightly%20woven%20fabric%2C%20which%20can%20be%20less%20susceptible%20to%20cracking%2C%20shifting%2C%20and%20punctures%20from%20claws.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785024001000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a64fcfd548c9c486b3109bc%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fpets%2Fbest-dog-car-seat-covers%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22We%20tested%209%20dog%20car%20seat%20covers%20to%20find%20the%20best%20options%20for%20mud%2C%20fur%2C%20and%20water.%20See%20our%20top%20picks%20for%20the%20bench%20and%20hammock%20styles.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Sophia%20Carlisle)%22