%2C%20which%20wasn't%20originally%20on%20the%20market.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EMutz%20developed%20a%20relationship%20with%20the%20owners%20that%20paid%20off%20when%20they%20eventually%20decided%20to%20sell.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EThis%20as-told-to%20essay%20is%20based%20on%20a%20conversation%20with%20Ben%20Mutz%2C%2039%2C%20a%20retired%20Air%20Force%20officer%20who%20bought%20a%20home%20that%20wasn't%20originally%20for%20sale%20in%20Oakwood%2C%20Ohio.%20Mutz%20used%20Unlisted%2C%20an%20app%20that%20allows%20prospective%20buyers%20to%20waitlist%20themselves%20on%20homes%20that%20are%20not%20yet%20on%20the%20market.%20The%20following%20has%20been%20edited%20for%20length%20and%20clarity.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20recently%20engaged%2C%20and%20we're%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnew-years-resolutions-to-set-for-kids-blended-family-2023-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eblending%20families%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20I'm%20going%20from%20a%20three-bedroom%20home%20to%20a%20six-bedroom%20home.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fpros-cons-moving-big-city-small-town-family-relocation-2026-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EOur%20community's%20pretty%20small%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20with%20about%201%2C200%20homes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20aren't%20a%20whole%20lot%20of%20six-bedroom%20homes%20in%20our%20neighborhood%20%E2%80%94%20we'll%20have%20five%20kids%20between%20my%20fianc%C3%A9e%20and%20me%20%E2%80%94%20so%20we%20were%20already%20working%20with%20a%20very%20limited%20market.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20moved%20quite%20a%20bit%20%E2%80%94%20this%20is%20my%20seventh%20duty%20station%2C%20and%20I've%20probably%20lived%20in%20about%2015%20houses%20between%20those%20seven%20different%20stops.%20So%20I'm%20very%20familiar%20with%20the%20moving%20process%2C%20both%20from%20a%20rental%20as%20well%20as%20from%20an%20ownership%20standpoint.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20rented%20the%20house%20I%20was%20in%20for%20two%20years%2C%20and%20I%20decided%20to%20purchase%20it.%20I%20did%20the%20entire%20process%20without%20an%20agent%2C%20and%20it%20really%20opened%20my%20eyes%20to%20see%20that%20there's%20a%20different%20way%20of%20doing%20things%20than%20the%20traditional%20way.%20There%20are%20a%20lot%20of%20tools%20that%20are%20out%20there%20and%20readily%20available%2C%20where%20you%20can%20facilitate%20your%20own%20sale%20in%20an%20easier%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20first%20heard%20about%20Unlisted%2C%20it%20was%20getting%20off%20the%20ground.%20I%20was%20like%2C%20%26quot%3BWow%2C%20this%20is%20an%20amazing%20concept.%26quot%3B%20I%20was%20able%20to%20use%20the%20platform%20to%20search%20and%20see%20which%20six-bedroom%20homes%20are%20available.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221278%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Six%20people%20in%20Chicago%20Bulls%20apparel%20pose%20before%20a%20basketball%20statue%20and%20holiday%20decorations%20inside%20an%20arena%20concourse.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5a45f1ce52cb26b839099e%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221688%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMutz%20and%20his%20family.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Ben%20Mutz%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20a%20few%20months%2C%20I%20found%20our%20dream%20home%3A%20It%20had%20the%20square%20footage%2C%20the%20size%2C%20and%20the%20number%20of%20bedrooms.%20The%20listing%20had%20a%20couple%20of%20photos%2C%20and%20it%20had%20a%20cool%20story%20about%20the%20home%20and%20some%20of%20the%20history%20behind%20it.%20I%20favorited%20it%2C%20and%20I%20was%20added%20to%20the%20waitlist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20through%20the%20grace%20of%20God%20and%20a%20little%20bit%20of%20good%20luck%2C%20a%20couple%20of%20months%20later%2C%20someone%20mentioned%20to%20me%20that%20their%20neighbor%20was%20moving.%20I%20was%20like%2C%20%26quot%3BOh%2C%20cool%2C%20where%20are%20they%20located%3F%26quot%3B%20They%20told%20me%2C%20and%20I%20was%20able%20to%20cross-reference%20on%20Unlisted%20and%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BThat's%20on%20my%20list.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20got%20in%20touch%20with%20the%20owners%20last%20fall%20through%20Unlisted%2C%20and%20over%20the%20course%20of%20a%20couple%20months%2C%20we%20were%20able%20to%20execute%20the%20sale.%20I%20closed%20in%20July%202026.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e71b5b36-1a99-4571-b820-0fbc7d130b21%5C%22%3EI%20built%20a%20relationship%20with%20the%20owners%20before%20they%20decided%20to%20sell%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20seller%20side%20of%20Unlisted%2C%20you%20can%20claim%20your%20property%3B%20you%20can%20update%20pictures%20and%20add%20your%20own%20owner%20evaluation.%20The%20owner%20had%20an%20evaluation%20which%20told%20me%2C%20%26quot%3BHey%2C%20we're%20potentially%20open%20to%20selling.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20developed%20an%20incredible%20friendship%20with%20them.%20Over%20the%20course%20of%20about%20six%20months%2C%20we%20would%20text%20about%20sports%2C%20we%20would%20text%20about%20life%2C%20share%20photos%20of%20our%20kids%20and%20of%20our%20dogs.%20We%20built%20the%20connection%20that%20you%20don't%20traditionally%20get%20in%20a%20normal%20home%20sale.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20a%20long%20process%2C%20but%20part%20of%20the%20reason%20it%20took%20so%20long%20was%20that%20the%20homeowners%20weren't%20retiring%20until%20June.%20So%20we%20agreed%20on%20a%20price%20in%20November%2C%20and%20as%20their%20retirement%20plans%20firmed%20up%2C%20in%20March%2C%20I%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BHey%2C%20we%20probably%20need%20to%20have%20a%20contract%20in%20place.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20dad%20is%20a%20very%20skeptical%20man%2C%20and%20he%20was%20like%2C%20%26quot%3BIf%20you%20don't%20have%20a%20contract%2C%20they're%20going%20to%20find%20out%20they%20can%20get%20more%20money%2C%20and%20you%20may%20lose%20this%20house%20before%20you%20know%20it.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20reached%20out%20to%20them%2C%20they%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BBen%2C%20we%20consider%20you%20family.%20We%20are%20good.%26quot%3B%20And%20I%20thought%2C%20%26quot%3BAll%20right%2C%20the%20pressure's%20off.%26quot%3B%20I%20don't%20have%20to%20worry%20about%20losing%20the%20house.%20We%20can%20do%20it%20at%20our%20own%20pace.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20we've%20developed%20such%20a%20friendship%20through%20the%20process%2C%20we%20were%20flexible%20with%20the%20closing%20being%20around%20their%20retirement%20day.%20It%20was%20a%20timeframe%20that%20worked%20well%20for%20both%20of%20us.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221290%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Large%20brick%20Tudor-style%20house%20with%20red%20tile%20roof%2C%20landscaped%20garden%2C%20and%20brick%20walkway%20leading%20to%20the%20front%20door.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5a45f1548c9c486b30d49a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22959%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMutz's%20home%20in%20Oakwood%2C%20Ohio.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Ben%20Mutz%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20live%20in%20a%20very%20active%20real%20estate%20market%2C%20where%20if%20a%20home%20comes%20to%20market%20and%20it's%20a%20good%20deal%2C%20it's%20usually%20sold%20within%20two%20or%20three%20days.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20bought%20our%20house%20for%20%24800%2C000%2C%20but%20it%20appraised%20at%20%24960%2C000%2C%20so%20I%20feel%20that%20we%20got%20an%20incredible%20deal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20it%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fnew-yorkers-buying-luxury-real-estate-off-market-2022-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ehit%20the%20market%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20it%20would%20have%20sold%20very%20quickly%20and%20probably%20for%20more%20than%20what%20we%20were%20able%20to%20negotiate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222600153a-6827-4b3d-8a24-08a1a73bbfc0%5C%22%3EUsing%20Unlisted%20was%20different%20than%20any%20other%20home%20transaction%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20other%20listing%20sites%2C%20you're%20limited%20by%20what's%20out%20there%20for%20sale.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EYes%2C%20you%20can%20pull%20up%20any%20house%20on%20Zillow%2C%20and%20it's%20going%20to%20give%20you%20the%20overview%2C%20but%20you%20don't%20know%20if%20that%20family%20moved%20in%2020%20years%20ago%2C%20one%20year%20ago%2C%20or%20whether%20they%20have%20any%20intentions%20of%20ever%20considering%20moving.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20house%20that%20I%20purchased%20was%20not%20the%20only%20one%20that%20I%20inquired%20about%20on%20Unlisted.%20I%20was%20able%20to%20talk%20with%20a%20few%20other%20families%20on%20there%20about%20their%20home%2C%20and%20they%20emailed%20over%20pictures%2C%20and%20some%20of%20them%20weren't%20within%20our%20price%20range%2C%20or%20some%20of%20them%20were%20not%20a%20fit%20from%20a%20layout%20standpoint.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20done%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbuy-and-sell-house-without-a-real-estate-agent-stories-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etraditional%20home%20sales%3C%2Fa%3E%20with%20real%20estate%20agents%20where%20we%20know%20it's%20going%20to%20be%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmost-competitive-rental-real-estate-market-apartments-housing-crisis-homes-2024-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20competitive%20market%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20so%20we've%20written%20a%20personalized%20note%20so%20the%20owners%20see%20us%20not%20only%20as%20buyers%2C%20but%20as%20a%20family%20that%20will%20continue%20the%20next%20legacy%20in%20their%20home.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221290%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20people%20wearing%20sunglasses%20pose%20together%20beside%20a%20fountain%20and%20colorful%20flowers%20in%20a%20sunny%20outdoor%20plaza.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5a45f1ce52cb26b83909a0%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221695%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMutz%20and%20his%20fianc%C3%A9e.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Ben%20Mutz%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20value%20of%20an%20interpersonal%20connection%20with%20a%20buyer%20and%20seller%20is%20always%20important%2C%20but%20Unlisted%20allowed%20us%20to%20go%20directly%20to%20them.%20Normally%2C%20your%20agents%20are%20the%20middleman%20and%20middlewoman%20facilitating%20the%20deals%2C%20but%20we%20were%20able%20to%20very%20quickly%20get%20to%20know%20each%20other%20and%20really%20get%20connected%20on%20a%20personal%20level%20in%20a%20different%20way%20than%20I've%20ever%20done%20through%20any%20other%20home%20transaction.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20homeowners%20were%20going%20to%20retire%20and%20move%20out%20of%20state%20regardless.%20But%20it%20was%20the%20personal%20connection%20that%20we%20built%20with%20them%20that%20helped%20us%20secure%20the%20home.%20They%20loved%20our%20story%20of%20two%20families%20coming%20together%2C%20and%20the%20home%20we're%20moving%20into%20is%20100-plus%20years%20old%20with%20a%20deep%20history.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20were%20genuinely%20excited%20for%20us%20to%20get%20the%20opportunity%20to%20live%20there%20and%20make%20it%20the%20next%20chapter%20of%20the%20home's%20story.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fi-bought-my-dream-home-not-listed-for-sale-unlisted-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785019513000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5a4764ce52cb26b83909af%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fi-bought-my-dream-home-not-listed-for-sale-unlisted-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Ben%20Mutz%20found%20his%20dream%20home%20using%20Unlisted%2C%20an%20app%20that%20lets%20buyers%20contact%20homeowners%20to%20see%20if%20they'd%20sell.%20He%20waited%20months%20but%20ultimately%20bought%20the%20home.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jpandy%40insider.com%20(Jordan%20Pandy)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A10%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22IFF%20says%20govt%20order%20to%20GitHub%20on%20BitChat%20unconstitutional%2C%20demands%20its%20withdrawal%22