ent%20for%20the%20public%20and%20research%20community%20to%20study.%20And%20then%20he%20asked%20for%20%24100%20million%20worth%20of%20%26quot%3Bcompute%26quot%3B%20to%20help%20Hugging%20Face%20bolster%20its%20cyber%20defenses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20first%20autonomous%20agent%20cyberattack%20is%20an%20unprecedented%20event%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20wrote.%20%26quot%3BIt%20deserves%20an%20unprecedented%20response!%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20did%20not%20immediately%20respond%20to%20a%20request%20for%20comment%20from%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-open-source-ai-approach-2023-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EHugging%20Face%3C%2Fa%3E%20operates%20a%20widely%20used%20platform%20that%20enables%20developers%20and%20companies%20to%20host%2C%20share%2C%20and%20download%20AI%20models%20and%20datasets.%20OpenAI%2C%20meanwhile%2C%20builds%20proprietary%20models%2C%20but%20maintains%20a%20presence%20on%20Hugging%20Face%2C%20where%20versions%20of%20some%20of%20its%20open%20models%20and%20research%20materials%20are%20available.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELast%20week%2C%20however%2C%20Hugging%20Face%20was%20struck%20with%20a%20security%20breach%20when%20an%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fai-agents-taking-on-work-challenge-of-scaling-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eautonomous%20AI%20agent%3C%2Fa%3E%20accessed%20some%20of%20its%20internal%20datasets.%20The%20culprits%3A%20OpenAI's%20latest%20models%2C%20GPT%E2%80%915.6%20Sol%2C%20and%20a%20new%20model%20yet%20to%20be%20released.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHugging%20Face%20first%20disclosed%20the%20intrusion%20on%20July%2016%2C%20saying%20an%20autonomous%20agent%20had%20accessed%20a%20limited%20number%20of%20internal%20datasets%20and%20service%20credentials.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFive%20days%20later%2C%20OpenAI%20said%20that%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fopenai-gpt-5-6-limited-preview-us-government-ai-security-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGPT-5.6%20Sol%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20a%20more%20powerful%2C%20unreleased%20model%20had%20been%20undergoing%20an%20internal%20cybersecurity%20evaluation%20with%20some%20safety%20restrictions%20reduced.%20The%20models%20were%20attempting%20to%20solve%20ExploitGym%2C%20a%20benchmark%20designed%20to%20test%20advanced%20hacking%20abilities.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpenAI%20said%20the%20models%20appeared%20narrowly%20focused%20on%20succeeding%20at%20the%20benchmark%20rather%20than%20intentionally%20targeting%20Hugging%20Face.%20The%20company%20called%20the%20episode%20an%20%26quot%3Bunprecedented%20cyber%20incident%26quot%3B%20and%20said%20it%20was%20working%20with%20Hugging%20Face%20on%20the%20investigation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENews%20of%20the%20hack%20elicited%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsmart-people-react-openai-hugging-face-hacking-cybersecurity-incident-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ea%20worried%20response%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20tech%20leaders.%20Billionaire%20LinkedIn%20cofounder%20Reid%20Hoffman%20said%20in%20an%20X%20post%20last%20week%20that%20the%20hack%20signaled%20the%20dawn%20of%20a%20new%20era%20of%20asymmetric%20warfare%20where%20%26quot%3Boffense%20gets%20cheaper%2C%20more%20distributed%2C%20and%20more%20numerous%2C%20while%20defense%20stays%20expensive%2C%20centralized%2C%20and%20designed%20for%20the%20last%20war.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDelangue%2C%20meanwhile%2C%20made%20the%20most%20of%20his%20trip%20to%20San%20Francisco.%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3EWhile%20there%2C%20he%20organized%20a%20%26quot%3Bmini%20march%26quot%3B%20on%20Saturday%20in%20support%20of%20open-source%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmicrosoft-nvidia-meta-palantir-jensen-huang-open-source-ai-letter-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eopen-weight%20AI%20models%3C%2Fa%3E.%20The%20debate%20over%20open-sourced%20competition%20from%20China%2C%20and%20how%20the%20United%20States%20might%20respond%2C%20was%20the%20other%20big%20AI%20story%20of%20last%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785010861000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a651438ce52cb26b8393fb6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhugging-face-ceo-clem-delangue-openai-rogue-agent-hack-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Hugging%20Face%20CEO%20Clem%20Delangue%20met%20with%20OpenAI%20this%20week%20to%20discuss%20the%20%26quot%3Bunprecedented%26quot%3B%20hack%20on%20its%20systems%20by%20an%20agent%20running%20on%20OpenAI%20models.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22lvaranasi%40businessinsider.com%20(Lakshmi%20Varanasi)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A97%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Ram%20Temple%20donation%20theft%20row%3A%20UP%20govt%20reconstitutes%20SIT%3B%20IG%20Kiran%20S%20to%20lead%20probe%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1785010769000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132633278%2Cimgsize-1231204.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Findia%2Fram-temple-donation-theft-row-up-govt-reconstitutes-sit-ig-kiran-s-to-lead-probe%2Farticleshow%2F132633276.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Uttar%20Pradesh%20government%20formed%20a%20new%20SIT%20to%20investigate%20alleged%20embezzlement%20of%20temple%20offerings.%20This%20team%2C%20led%20by%20senior%20IPS%20officers%2C%20replaces%20the%20earlier%20investigation%20panel.%20The%20Supreme%20Court%20directed%20the%20state%20to%20form%20a%20fresh%20SIT%20under%20a%20senior%20IPS%20officer.%20Investigators%20previously%20examined%20financial%20records%20and%20questioned%20temple%20staff%20about%20donation%20irregularities.%20The%20new%20SIT%2