r%20vehicle%20in%20Africa%20smiling%20with%20elephant%20in%20background%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6395d4ce52cb26b83939ff%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EUltimately%2C%20a%20safari%20was%20a%20cool%20way%20to%20celebrate%20a%20milestone%20birthday%2C%20and%20I'm%20glad%20it%20wasn't%20as%20pricey%20as%20I%20had%20expected.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EFor%20my%20husband's%2050th%20birthday%2C%20we%20traveled%20the%20world%20and%20did%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffirst-african-safari-trip-best-things-i-did-regret-zanzibar-2025-3%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efirst%20African%20safari%3C%2Fa%3E%20together.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EWe%20saw%20elephants%2C%20giraffes%2C%20and%20many%20other%20animals%20up%20close%2C%20and%20had%20dinner%20in%20the%20bush.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOne%20day%20of%20safari%20would've%20been%20enough%2C%20but%20we%20had%20a%20good%20experience%2C%20and%20the%20price%20felt%20fair.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EBusiness-class%20airline%20tickets%20were%20already%20booked%20for%20us%20to%20fly%20around%20the%20world%20for%20my%20husband's%2050th%20birthday.%20Then%20he%20threw%20me%20a%20curveball%3A%20An%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbungalow-inside-kruger-national-park-review-2024-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EAfrican%20safari%3C%2Fa%3E%20was%20on%20his%20bucket%20list%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20wanted%20to%20fulfill%20his%20wish%20while%20keeping%20money%20and%20time%20constraints%20in%20mind.%20After%20all%2C%20when%20I%20heard%20%26quot%3BAfrican%20safari%2C%26quot%3B%20all%20I%20could%20see%20was%20dollar%20signs%20%E2%80%94%20and%20not%20in%20a%20good%20way.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPlus%2C%20we%20had%20only%20seven%20days%20in%20South%20Africa%2C%20not%20including%20the%20travel%20days%20in%20and%20out%20of%20Johannesburg%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcape-town-south-africa-things-to-love-food-hikes-art-2022-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ECape%20Town%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20a%20deep%20dive%20into%20Google%20searches%20and%20countless%20reviews%2C%20I%20booked%20a%20three-day%2C%20two-night%20safari%20for%20two%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-go-south-african-safari-cheap-kruger-national-park-2024%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EKruger%20National%20Park%3C%2Fa%3E%20through%20SafariWithUs%20for%20around%2027%2C000%20rands%2C%20which%20converted%20to%20just%20under%20%241%2C500%20at%20the%20time.%20It%20included%20transportation%20in%20an%20air-conditioned%20van%2C%20hotel%20accommodations%2C%20and%20two%20meals%20a%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20safari%20experience%20was%20more%20affordable%20than%20I%20expected%2C%20and%20I%20hoped%20it'd%20be%20a%20great%20value%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%220278bd31-211d-403a-803c-d539d88673f6%5C%22%3EAlthough%20we%20were%20nervous%2C%20our%20trip%20got%20off%20to%20a%20strong%20start%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Couple%20smiling%20in%20Alzu%20Petroport%20South%20Africa%20sign%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a63961d54f987526177978f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EOur%20ride%20to%20the%20hotel%20included%20a%20stop%20at%20Alzu%20Petroport.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20first%20day%20of%20the%20safari%2C%20we%20waited%20anxiously%20at%20our%20hotel%20in%20Johannesburg%20for%20our%20ride.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUp%20until%20then%2C%20every%20detail%20of%20the%20safari%20had%20been%20handled%20over%20email.%20So%2C%20when%20our%20friendly%20driver%20arrived%2C%20we%20breathed%20a%20sigh%20of%20relief.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOn%20the%20way%20to%20our%20lodge%2C%20he%20stopped%20at%20Alzu%20Petroport%2C%20which%20he%20called%20%26quot%3Bthe%20world's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fkwik-trip-beats-wawa-sheetz-buc-ees-in-c-store-customer-satisfaction-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebest%20gas%20station%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%26quot%3B%20where%20we%20could%20stretch%20our%20legs%20for%20a%20bit.%20It%20had%20tons%20of%20items%20for%20sale%20and%20several%20restaurants%20inside%2C%20plus%20it%20was%20surrounded%20by%20nature.%20Just%20outside%2C%20we%20spotted%20rhinoceros%2C%20giving%20us%20a%20cool%20preview%20of%20the%20wildlife%20we%20would%20see.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20arrived%20at%20the%20lodge%20around%20mid-afternoon.%20My%20husband%20can't%20sleep%20without%20air%20conditioning%2C%20so%20he%20was%20relieved%20to%20discover%20a%20unit%20in%20our%20room.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20settling%20in%20and%20a%20quick%20rest%2C%20it%20was%20time%20for%20our%20first%20game%20drive.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22aedcc5d1-fa0e-4eac-b46b-aefff83d2b9c%5C%22%3EOur%20first%20day%20included%20close%20calls%20and%20dinner%20in%20the%20bush%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221126%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Two%20giraffes%20in%20tall%20grass%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a63969554f98752617797a1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22845%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20got%20to%20see%20giraffes%20during%20the%20drive.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20guide%20drove%20the%20safari%20vehicle%2C%20which%20was%20covered%20on%20top%20but%20otherwise%20completely%20open%20to%20the%20elements.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20other%20pro%20on%20board%2C%20the%20tracker%2C%20sat%20in%20a%20chair%20on%20the%20hood%20of%20the%20vehicle.%20It%20looked%20like%20he%20was%20barely%20hanging%20on%2C%20and%20I%20thought%20it%20was%20cool%20and%20also%20scary.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Lions%20in%20tall%20grass%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638b4054f9875261779709%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20tracker%20helped%20spot%20wildlife%20during%20the%20game%20drive.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20spotted%20giraffes%2C%20hyenas%2C%20elephants%2C%20and%20a%20large%20herd%20of%20water%20buffalo.%20We%20also%20saw%20impalas%2C%20known%20as%20the%20%26quot%3BMcDonald's%26quot%3B%20of%20the%20bush%2C%20our%20guide%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELike%20the%20fast-food%20chain%2C%20they're%20everywhere%20and%20an%20abundant%20food%20source%20(in%20this%20case%2C%20for%20lions%2C%20leopards%2C%20and%20cheetahs).%20The%20nickname%20gets%20funnier%20when%20you%20notice%20the%20black%20markings%20in%20the%20shape%20of%20an%20%26quot%3BM%26quot%3B%20on%20their%20light-colored%20behinds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221600%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Elephant%20followed%20by%20baby%20elephant%20in%20tall%20g%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638b40548c9c486b3103e6%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22900%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EWe%20got%20closer%20to%20elephants%20than%20I%20expected%20we%20would.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ELater%2C%20we%20had%20a%20close%20encounter%20with%20a%20young%20elephant%2C%20who%20seemed%20to%20be%20guarding%20his%20mother.%20I%20was%20sitting%20on%20the%20right%20side%20of%20the%20vehicle%2C%20the%20same%20side%20as%20the%20elephants%2C%20and%20my%20husband%20kept%20telling%20me%20to%20scoot%20in%20closer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20we%20slowly%20drove%20past%2C%20the%20young%20elephant%20suddenly%20let%20out%20a%20loud%20trumpet%2C%20making%20us%20both%20jump.%20After%20our%20hearts%20stopped%20pounding%2C%20we%20laughed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Elephant%20walking%20into%20road%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638b4054f987526177970a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221126%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EIt%20was%20incredible%20to%20see%20wildlife%20up%20close.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20night%20wrapped%20up%20with%20a%20dinner%20deep%20in%20the%20bush%20at%20a%20secluded%20spot%20I%20have%20no%20idea%20how%20the%20guides%20even%20found.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20being%20in%20the%20wild%2C%20the%20guides%20managed%20to%20set%20up%20an%20elegant%20dinner%20table%20complete%20with%20dim%20lighting%20and%20folded%20napkins.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Candle-lit%20meal%20outdoors%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a639644ce52cb26b8393a0c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI've%20never%20had%20a%20meal%20like%20this%20before.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20had%20chicken%20and%20a%20yummy%20sausage%20with%20vegetables%2C%20all%20cooked%20over%20an%20open%20flame.%20A%20hyena%20nicknamed%20%26quot%3BBob%26quot%3B%20lurked%20nearby%20while%20we%20ate.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a4446522-29c5-43b6-817a-90ce65680ab5%5C%22%3EThe%20experience%20was%20worth%20it%2C%20but%20I%20would've%20been%20happy%20with%20a%20shorter%20trip%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Animals%20in%20tall%20grass%20at%20sunet%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6396c5548c9c486b310483%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EI%20would've%20been%20happy%20with%20just%20one%20day%20and%20evening%20of%20safari%20drives.%3Cp%3ERuth%20Bayang%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EHonestly%2C%20that%20one%20day%20and%20evening%20of%20safari%20was%20enough%20for%20me.%20I%20would%20have%20been%20perfectly%20happy%20heading%20back%20to%20Johannesburg%20after%20breakfast%20the%20next%20morning.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20my%20view%2C%20days%20two%20and%20three%20didn't%20add%20a%20whole%20lot%20more%20to%20our%20experience.%20We%20saw%20different%20animals%20like%20hippopotami%2C%20zebras%2C%20lions%2C%20and%20an%20ostrich%2C%20but%20otherwise%20it%20was%20much%20of%20the%20same.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20definitely%20could've%20saved%20money%20and%20still%20had%20a%20great%20experience%20by%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fspontaneous-travel-weekend-trip-getaways-tsa-chaos-oil-prices-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebooking%20a%20shorter%20trip%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt's%20also%20definitely%20possible%20to%20do%20a%20safari%20of%20this%20length%20for%20two%20for%20less%20than%20%241%2C500%2C%20especially%20if%20you%20opt%20for%20self-drive%20safaris%20and%20campsites%20instead%20of%20hotels.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EEven%20so%2C%20our%20experience%20felt%20like%20a%20solid%20value.%20For%20our%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffirst-african-safari-trip-mistakes-lessons-learned-packing-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efirst%20time%20on%20a%20safari%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20I%20appreciated%20having%20knowledgeable%20(and%20armed!)%20guides%20who%20knew%20the%20lay%20of%20the%20land%2C%20behavior%20of%20the%20animals%2C%20and%20how%20to%20time%20our%20drives%20for%20the%20best%20sightings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbucket-list-trip-partner-50th-birthday-first-african-safari-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784995921000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6395f454f9875261779787%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbucket-list-trip-partner-50th-birthday-first-african-safari-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22To%20celebrate%20my%20partner's%2050th%20birthday%2C%20I%20planned%20a%20bucket-list%20trip%20around%20the%20world%20that%20included%20our%20first%20African%20safari%20and%20wildlife%20sightings.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Ruth%20Bayang)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A