0have%20laughed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBetween%20raising%20two%20daughters%20with%20my%20husband%20and%20running%20two%20businesses%2C%20my%20days%20are%20carefully%20orchestrated.%20My%20calendar%20is%20filled%20with%20client%20meetings%2C%20strategy%20sessions%2C%20school%20pickups%2C%20and%20the%20thousand%20small%20responsibilities%20that%20come%20with%20parenting.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fguides%2Fhome%2Fthe-best-indoor-herb-garden%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EGardening%3C%2Fa%3E%20simply%20didn't%20fit%20into%20the%20picture%20I%20had%20of%20my%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20also%20never%20been%20someone%20who%20meticulously%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbest-tips-buying-cheap-groceries-for-big-family%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3E%20tracked%20grocery%20prices%20%3C%2Fa%3Eor%20planned%20shopping%20trips%20around%20weekly%20sales.%20Convenience%20usually%20wins.%20But%20over%20the%20last%20few%20years%2C%20even%20someone%20like%20me%20couldn't%20ignore%20how%20dramatically%20the%20cost%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Flong-lasting-fresh-food-produce-stock-up-work-from-home-coronavirus-shopping%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efresh%20food%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20changed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20wasn't%20that%20we%20suddenly%20couldn't%20afford%20groceries.%20It%20was%20the%20realization%20that%20we%20were%20spending%20an%20astonishing%20amount%20on%20produce%20that%20disappeared%20almost%20as%20quickly%20as%20we%20brought%20it%20home.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%207-year-old%20daughter%20could%20happily%20eat%20strawberries%20every%20day%20if%20we%20let%20her.%20Fresh%20herbs%20rarely%20lasted%20the%20week%20before%20wilting.%20Tomatoes%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrying-ina-garten-salad-recipes-review-winner-easy-2024-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecucumbers%2C%20salad%20greens%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20and%20blueberries%20were%20staples%20in%20our%20home%2C%20yet%20I%20felt%20like%20I%20was%20constantly%20replacing%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Leafy%20green%20vegetables%20grow%20densely%20in%20a%20raised%20metal%20garden%20bed%20beside%20a%20white%20vinyl%20fence.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a611fdf54f9875261778772%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20backyard%20garden%20in%20Maryland.%3Cp%3EMia%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThen%20my%20mom%20offered%20a%20suggestion%20that%20completely%20changed%20how%20I%20thought%20about%20our%20grocery%20bill.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20parents%20have%20always%20had%20incredible%20gardens.%20Growing%20up%2C%20our%20yard%20was%20filled%20with%20flowers%2C%20herbs%2C%20and%20vegetables%2C%20and%20in%20recent%20years%2C%20it%20expanded%20into%20a%20greenhouse%20that%20produces%20everything%20from%20corn%20to%20melons%20to%20peppers%20and%20so%20much%20more.%20I%20admired%20what%20they%20had%20built%2C%20but%20I%20viewed%20it%20as%20a%20retirement%20hobby%2C%20not%20something%20realistic%20for%20me%20as%20a%20busy%20entrepreneur.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20afternoon%2C%20after%20hearing%20me%20complain%20once%20again%20about%20how%20quickly%20my%20daughters%20were%20working%20their%20way%20through%20yet%20another%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freference%2Fhow-to-clean-strawberries%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Econtainer%20of%20strawberries%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20my%20mom%20simply%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BWhy%20don't%20you%20just%20grow%20them%3F%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20she%20told%20me%20their%20garden%20was%20saving%20them%20between%20%24100%20to%20%24200%20every%20month%20during%20the%20growing%20season%20(which%20is%20May%20through%20October%2C%20where%20we%20live%20in%20Maryland)%2C%20my%20perspective%20shifted.%20The%20financial%20savings%20were%20impressive%2C%20but%20what%20intrigued%20me%20even%20more%20was%20the%20possibility%20of%20becoming%20a%20little%20less%20dependent%20on%20constant%20trips%20to%20the%20grocery%20store.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f609f9a5-8d18-4f83-826f-21b2e71a3d45%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EI%20started%20off%20small%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20decided%20to%20start%20with%20what%20felt%20manageable%3A%20a%20few%20tomato%20plants%2C%20mint%2C%20basil%2C%20and%20a%20handful%20of%20herbs.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20was%20no%20grand%20plan%20to%20become%20self-sufficient%20or%20transform%20my%20backyard%20into%20a%20miniature%20farm.%20I%20simply%20wanted%20to%20see%20whether%20growing%20a%20few%20things%20myself%20would%20make%20a%20meaningful%20difference.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20did.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Basket%20of%20freshly%20picked%20yellow%20squash%2C%20green%20peppers%2C%20and%20herbs%20held%20in%20a%20sunny%20residential%20yard.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a612015548c9c486b30f46b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20harvest.%3Cp%3EMia%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhat%20began%20as%20a%20small%20experiment%20gradually%20evolved%20into%20something%20bigger.%20Each%20season%2C%20I%20found%20myself%20adding%20another%20fruit%2C%20another%20vegetable%2C%20another%20lesson.%20Three%20years%20later%2C%20our%20garden%20produces%20strawberries%2C%20blueberries%2C%20collard%20greens%2C%20broccoli%2C%20squash%2C%20peppers%2C%20watermelon%2C%20cucumbers%2C%20onions%2C%20potatoes%2C%20lettuce%2C%20herbs%2C%20and%20more.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20financial%20impact%20surprised%20me%2C%20too.%20During%20peak%20growing%20season%2C%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarted-home-garden-no-experience-save-money-on-groceries-2025-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Eour%20garden%3C%2Fa%3E%20offsets%20roughly%20%24500%20worth%20of%20produce%20for%20our%20family%20of%20four%20each%20month.%20The%20items%20that%20once%20seemed%20to%20dominate%20every%20grocery%20receipt%20are%20often%20waiting%20just%20steps%20outside%20our%20back%20door%20instead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFresh%20herbs%20are%20probably%20the%20most%20satisfying%20example.%20Before%20gardening%2C%20I'd%20spend%20money%20on%20basil%2C%20cilantro%2C%20parsley%2C%20or%20mint%20only%20to%20use%20a%20portion%20before%20the%20rest%20inevitably%20spoiled%20in%20the%20refrigerator.%20Now%2C%20I%20harvest%20exactly%20what%20I%20need%20moments%20before%20cooking.%20Nothing%20goes%20to%20waste%20because%20nothing%20sits%20forgotten%20in%20the%20produce%20drawer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20same%20is%20true%20for%20tomatoes%2C%20cucumbers%2C%20peppers%2C%20and%20lettuce.%20Instead%20of%20adding%20them%20to%20every%20grocery%20list%2C%20we're%20picking%20them%20ourselves%20for%20salads%2C%20sandwiches%2C%20or%20dinner%20that%20evening.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Round%20green%20fruit%20grows%20on%20a%20leafy%20vine%20supported%20by%20a%20wooden%20garden%20trellis.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a61207b548c9c486b30f476%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20watermelon%20growing%20in%20the%20author's%20garden.%3Cp%3EMia%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22a23a8253-289f-4ac9-85cd-cff8f0537328%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EGardening%20is%20still%20an%20investment%20of%20time%20and%20money%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOf%20course%2C%20gardening%20isn't%20free.%20There%20are%20upfront%20costs%20for%20raised%20beds%20(about%20%24225)%2C%20soil%20(%24100)%2C%20fertilizer%20(%2460)%2C%20tools%20(%24100)%2C%20and%20seeds%20and%20plants%20(%2460).%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThere%20are%20also%20disappointments.%20Not%20every%20seed%20thrives.%20Some%20crops%20produce%20more%20than%20others.%20Pests%20like%20caterpillars%2C%20slugs%2C%20and%20Japanese%20beetles%20occasionally%20remind%20you%20that%20you're%20sharing%20the%20harvest%20with%20nature.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20unlike%20so%20many%20household%20expenses%2C%20the%20investment%20continues%20paying%20dividends%20season%20after%20season%20for%20our%20family.%20Many%20plants%20return%20each%20year%2C%20and%20every%20growing%20season%20teaches%20me%20how%20to%20become%20more%20efficient%20than%20the%20last.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Fresh%20green%20herbs%20and%20peppers%20sit%20in%20a%20stainless%20steel%20bowl%20held%20outdoors%20near%20garden%20plants.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a612213ce52cb26b8392a14%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222667%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20peppermint%2C%20peppers%2C%20and%20basil%20from%20her%20garden.%3Cp%3EMia%20Davis%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20most%20meaningful%20return%2C%20however%2C%20has%20had%20nothing%20to%20do%20with%20money.%20My%20daughters%20now%20understand%20that%20food%20simply%20doesn't%20appear%20on%20grocery%20shelves.%20They've%20watched%20tiny%20seedlings%20become%20meals%20we%20share%20around%20our%20kitchen%20table.%20They%20celebrate%20the%20first%20ripe%20strawberry%20of%20summer.%20They%20race%20outside%20to%20see%20whether%20another%20watermelon%20has%20grown%20overnight.%20Vegetables%20become%20infinitely%20more%20exciting%20when%20they've%20helped%20water%20them%20and%20patiently%20waited%20for%20them%20to%20mature.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20someone%20whose%20professional%20life%20revolves%20around%20strategy%20and%20deadlines%2C%20gardening%20has%20also%20become%20an%20unexpected%20form%20of%20stillness.%20There%20is%20something%20profoundly%20grounding%20about%20stepping%20outside%20before%20opening%20my%20laptop%2C%20harvesting%20vegetables%20for%20dinner%2C%20or%20watering%20plants%20without%20checking%20my%20phone%20every%20few%20minutes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIronically%2C%20what%20I%20once%20dismissed%20as%20another%20responsibility%20has%20become%20one%20of%20the%20few%20activities%20that%20consistently%20pulls%20me%20into%20the%20present%20moment.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarted-garden-for-kids-save-500-month-groceries-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784993401000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a611f7bce52cb26b83929e5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstarted-garden-for-kids-save-500-month-groceries-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22As%20a%20busy%20entrepreneur%2C%20I%20didn't%20think%20I'd%20have%20time%20to%20garden.%20Still%2C%20it%20reduced%20my%20grocery%20costs%20and%20taught%20my%20daughters%20about%20the%20value%20of%20food.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22insider%40insider.com%20(Mia%20Davis)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Dharmendra%20Pradhan%20resigns%3A%20Sonakshi%20Sinha%20apologises%20to%20Gen%20Z%2C%20does%20sit-ups%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784993336000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.toiimg.com%2Fphoto%2Fmsid-132629340%2Cimgsize-245264.cms%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fentertainment%2Fhindi%2Fbollywood%2Fnews%2Fdharmendra-pradhan-resigns-sonakshi-sinha-apologises-does-sit-ups-im-the-artist-bro-but-gen-z-is-art%2Farticleshow%2F132629276.cms%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22%3Cimg%20border%3D%5C%220%5C%22%20align%3D%5C%22left%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fphoto%2F132629276.cms%5C%22%20hspace%3D%5C%2210%5C%22%3ESonakshi%20Sinha%20humorously%20apologized%20to%20Gen%20Z%20for%20underestimating%20them.%20She%20expressed%20her%20newfound%20respect%20for%20the%20younger%20generation's%20resilience.%20This%20came%20after%20Union%20Education%20Minister%20Dharmendra%20Pradhan%20stepped%20down%20from%20his%20post.%20Sinha%20shared%20a%20light-hearted%20video%20on%20Instagram%2C%20admitting%20her%20misjudgment.%20The%20actor%20thanked%20students%20for%20their%20impactful%20demonstrations%20and%20advocacy.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TOI%20Entertainment%20Desk%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A95%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Actor%20Ellie%20Bamber%20needed%20to%20become%20Kate%20Moss%20on-screen.%20Her%20trainer%20helped%20her%20do%20it%20without%20starvation.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222400%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Ellie%20Bamber%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4e6e93b3a8c16f7e8ec740%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221800%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EEllie%20Bamber%20worked%20with%20a%20trainer%20for%20her%20role%20as%20Kate%20Moss.%3Cp%3EJustin%20E%20Palmer%2FGC%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EEllie%20Bamber%20trained%20for%20more%20than%20two%20years%20to%20portray%20Kate%20Moss.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHer%20trainer%20focused%20on%20strength%20training%20instead%20of%20excessive%20cardio.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThe%20approach%20avoided%20calorie%20counting%20and%20restrictive%20dieting.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EIt%20was%20the%20era%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-eating-disorders-thin-90s-horrified-skinny-fashion-heroin-chic-2022-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eheroin%20chic%3C%2Fa%3E.%20When%20iconic%20supermodel%20Kate%20Moss%20was%20at%20the%20height%20of%20her%20modeling%20career%20in%20the%201990s%2C%20she%20was%20often%20pictured%20at%20clubs%20with%20a%20cigarette%2C%20a%20far%20cry%20from%20today's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freformer-pilates-new-luxury-hotel-amenity-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etrends%20of%20Pilates%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20matcha%20lattes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%20when%20actor%20Ellie%20Bamber%20came%20to%20play%20Moss%20in%20the%20recently%20released%20movie%20%26quot%3BMoss%20%26amp%3B%20Freud%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20had%20her%20work%20cut%20out.%20How%20to%20create%20Moss's%20supermodel%20physique%20without%20resorting%20to%20unhealthy%20methods%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223a695235-8099-44c8-9536-e9d988215eec%5C%22%3EShe%20worked%20with%20trainer%20Luke%20Worthington%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBamber%2C%20who%20has%20also%20starred%20in%20%26quot%3BRed%2C%20White%20%26amp%3B%20Royal%20Blue%26quot%3B%20and%20%26quot%3BWilliam%20Tell%2C%26quot%3B%20worked%20with%20film%20and%20TV%20personal%20trainer%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcelebrity-personal-trainer-how-eat-train-longevity-stay-fit-2024-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ELuke%20Worthington%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20prepare%20to%20embody%20Moss%2C%20a%20process%20that%20ultimately%20took%20years%20due%20to%20various%20filming%20delays.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWorthington%20and%20Bamber%20started%20working%20together%20in%20January%202022%20and%20focused%20on%20film%20prep%20from%20December%20of%20that%20year%2C%20expecting%20to%20shoot%20in%20summer%202023.%20Filming%20was%20postponed%20until%20spring%2Fsummer%202024.%20They%20also%20had%20to%20contend%20with%20a%20fractured%20ankle%2C%20but%20they%20got%20Bamber%20ready%20to%20play%20Moss%20with%20a%20startling%20likeness.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BUltimately%2C%20it%20wasn't%20going%20to%20be%20a%20perfect%20like-for-like%2C%20but%20we%20wanted%20to%20try%20to%20get%20as%20close%20to%20Kate%20as%20we%20could%2C%20but%20it%20was%20really%20important%20for%20both%20of%20us%20that%20I%20remained%20really%20healthy%2C%26quot%3B%20Bamber%20told%20Business%20Insider.%20%26quot%3BOne%20of%20the%20goals%20was%20also%20for%20me%20to%20feel%20good%2C%20because%20I'm%20nude%20quite%20a%20lot%20in%20the%20film%20and%20that's%20kind%20of%20daunting%20in%20itself%2C%20so%20I%20just%20wanted%20to%20feel%20really%20in%20tune%20with%20my%20body%20and%20really%20confident.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%202017%2C%20Kate%20Moss%20told%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.theguardian.com%2Ffashion%2F2017%2Fnov%2F16%2Fi-never-used-to-eat-salads-how-to-look-like-kate-moss-according-to-kate-moss%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EThe%20Guardian%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20she%20never%20used%20to%20eat%20salads%20or%20go%20to%20the%20gym.%20%26quot%3BEllie%20was%20portraying%20somebody%20who%20perhaps%20wasn't%20overly%20health-conscious%20at%20that%20particular%20phase%20of%20their%20life%2C%20but%20compromising%20her%20health%20was%20never%20going%20to%20be%20something%20that%20we%20would%20consider%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Worthington.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20how%20they%20made%20it%20happen.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22b7873f37-7a52-4870-b242-bca9405e2a27%5C%22%3EHigh-intensity%20strength%20training%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EBamber%20did%20high-intensity%20strength%20training%20at%20least%20three%20times%20a%20week%2C%20sometimes%20as%20many%20as%20five%20or%20six%2C%20but%20the%20extra%20sessions%20were%20a%20bonus.%20They%20would%20typically%20ratchet%20up%20training%20before%20supposedly%20starting%20filming%2C%20and%20then%20dial%20back%20to%20a%20more%20sustainable%20routine%20when%20things%20got%20delayed.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWorthington%20had%20Bamber%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-build-muscle-and-burn-fat-faster-with-supersets-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eworking%20in%20tri-sets%3C%2Fa%3E%20consisting%20of%20an%20upper-body%20exercise%2C%20a%20lower-body%20exercise%2C%20and%20a%20core%20exercise%2C%20back-to-back.%20This%20means%20that%20the%20blood%20rushes%20from%20one%20area%20of%20the%20body%20to%20another%2C%20improving%20cardiovascular%20capacity%20and%20building%20strength.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BFor%20example%2C%20she's%20doing%20a%20set%20of%20squats%20and%20a%20set%20of%20push-ups.%20If%20you%20do%20those%20on%20their%20own%2C%20they%20are%20strengthening%20exercises.%20If%20you%20do%20them%20back%20to%20back%2C%20there's%20the%20metabolic%20demands%2C%20the%20caloric%20demand%20of%20that%20goes%20exponentially%20higher%2C%26quot%3B%20Worthington%20said.%20%26quot%3BSo%2C%20by%20being%20smart%20about%20how%20we%20grouped%20exercises%20together%2C%20it%20meant%20that%20we%20could%20be%20quite%20efficient%20with%20the%20workouts%20and%20not%20keep%20her%20in%20the%20gym%20for%20hours.%20She's%20getting%20free%20cardio%2C%20basically.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22736%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Ellie%20Bamber%20working%20out%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4e6d5fd3b3e457651968fa%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22552%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EEllie%20Bamber%20had%20to%20work%20out%20with%20a%20boot%20after%20she%20broke%20her%20ankle%20while%20filming%20a%20movie.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Luke%20Worthington%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20Bamber%20fell%20off%20a%20horse%20while%20filming%20a%20different%20movie%20and%20broke%20her%20ankle%2C%20training%20had%20to%20be%20a%20little%20more%20creative.%20Alongside%20seeing%20a%20physio%2C%20Bamber%20would%20come%20to%20the%20gym%20on%20crutches%20with%20her%20boot%20on%2C%20and%20Worthington%20would%20have%20her%20do%20modified%20exercises%20targeting%20the%20rest%20of%20her%20body.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ee8120b6-e699-4988-b409-577b426f0072%5C%22%3ESlimming%20without%20calorie-counting%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EStrength%20training%20was%20also%20an%20important%20part%20of%20helping%20Bamber%20maintain%20muscle%20mass%20while%20sculpting%20a%20supermodel%20physique%20through%20a%20gentle%20calorie%20deficit.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20love%20pasta%2C%20and%20I%20still%20want%20to%20be%20able%20to%20go%20out%20for%20dinner%20with%20my%20friends%2C%26quot%3B%20Bamber%20said%2C%20so%20she%20didn't%20want%20to%20follow%20a%20restrictive%20diet%20plan.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%22736%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Ellie%20Bamber%20training%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4e6f46d3a449ec3445f475%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22552%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ELuke%20Worthington%20trained%20Ellie%20Bamber%20during%20her%20transformation%20into%20Kate%20Moss%20for%20a%20film.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Luke%20Worthington%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWith%20that%20in%20mind%2C%20there%20was%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-to-lose-weight-without-counting-calories-fat-loss-tips-2020-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eno%20calorie-counting%3C%2Fa%3E%20or%20weighing%20herself.%20They%20used%20photos%20to%20track%20Bamber's%20progress%20and%20aimed%20for%20a%20calorie%20deficit%20of%20no%20more%20than%2010%25%20(without%20strictly%20tracking).%20Worthington%20suggested%20loosely%20measuring%20portion%20sizes%20using%20her%20hands.%20The%20aim%20was%20to%20make%20slow%2C%20gradual%20changes%2C%20he%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BSlow%20and%20steady%20wins%20the%20race%2C%20and%20we%20communicated%20all%20the%20time%20about%20how%20Ellie's%20energy%2C%20mood%2C%20and%20concentration%20were%2C%20so%20we%20could%20see%20if%20we%20were%20pushing%20too%20hard%2C%26quot%3B%20Worthington%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d0bf15b7-2477-4b1e-a131-cfe9aefdb00a%5C%22%3EShe%20often%20drank%20smoothies%20for%20breakfast%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20she%20needed%20a%20weekend%20%26quot%3Boff%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20had%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20harder%20it%20is%20for%20someone%2C%20the%20less%20easy%20it%20is%20for%20them%20to%20stick%20to%20it%2C%26quot%3B%20Worthington%20said.%20%26quot%3BSo%20if%20we%20make%20one%20change%20at%20a%20time%2C%20and%20try%20to%20keep%20those%20changes%20manageable%2C%20you've%20got%20more%20of%20a%20chance%20of%20sticking%20to%20it%2C%20which%20means%20you%20get%20the%20result%20that%20you%20want.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20nutrition%20strategy%20evolved%3A%20For%20most%20of%20the%20prep%2C%20Bamber%20tried%20to%20eat%20six%20portions%20of%20cruciferous%20vegetables%20(like%20broccoli%20and%20cauliflower)%20per%20day%2C%20meaning%20she%20filled%20up%20on%20l%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhigh-volume-low-calorie-meals-snacks-fat-loss-dietitian-2023-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eow-calorie%2C%20high-volume%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20nutritious%20foods.%20The%20focus%20was%20on%20adding%2C%20rather%20than%20subtracting.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20often%20drank%20a%20breakfast%20smoothie%20consisting%20of%20greens%2C%20fruit%2C%20protein%2C%20and%20flax%20seeds.%20%26quot%3BIt%20was%20an%20easy%20way%20of%20getting%20a%20load%20of%20nutrients%20and%20a%20good%20amount%20of%20protein%20at%20the%20start%20of%20the%20day%20without%20excessive%20calories%2C%26quot%3B%20Worthington%20said.%20This%20then%20evolved%20to%20a%20yogurt%20bowl%20with%20skyr%20and%20similar%20ingredients.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20recovering%20from%20her%20fractured%20ankle%2C%20she%20moved%20to%20an%20intentional%20calorie%20surplus%20with%20plenty%20of%20protein%20to%20promote%20healing%20for%20six%20weeks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ELater%20in%20the%20process%2C%20Bamber%20began%20intermittent%20fasting%20while%20maintaining%20flexibility.%20If%20filming%20started%20early%2C%20she%20would%20eat%20earlier%20to%20have%20enough%20energy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIt%20was%20about%20finding%20a%20balance%20of%20pushing%20myself%20as%20hard%20as%20I%20could%2C%20but%20then%20also%20knowing%20that%20if%20I%20needed%20to%20back%20off%2C%20that%20was%20OK%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Bamber.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fellie-bamber-kate-moss-workout-diet-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784993281000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a4e6e9fd3b3e45765196900%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fww