ay-better-than-americas-independence-day-texas-influencers-enraged-by-advertisement-for-indian-independence-day-event-in-frisco%2Farticleshow%2F132628822.cms%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia-indiatimes-com.cdn.ampproject.org%2Fc%2Fs%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fway-better-than-americas-independence-day-texas-influencers-enraged-by-advertisement-for-indian-independence-day-event-in-frisco%2Famp_articleshow%2F132628822.cms%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fworld%2Fus%2Fway-better-than-americas-independence-day-texas-influencers-enraged-by-advertisement-for-indian-independence-day-event-in-frisco%2Famp_articleshow%2F132628822.cms%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22I%20attended%20pastry%20school%20in%20France.%20These%20are%20the%207%20most%20common%20mistakes%20I%20see%20home%20bakers%20make%20%E2%80%94%20and%20how%20to%20fix%20them.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20side-by-side%20image%20of%20the%20writer%20at%20a%20pastry%20class%20and%20an%20image%20of%20a%20cake%20decorated%20with%20intricate%20flowers%20and%20leaves%20made%20of%20frosting.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a63b78dce52cb26b8393c11%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221500%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAfter%20attending%20pastry%20school%2C%20I've%20noticed%20several%20mistakes%20that%20at-home%20bakers%20frequently%20make.%3Cp%3EAllison%20Chen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EAfter%20attending%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftips-for-making-best-cookies-from-professional-baker-2026-6%5C%22%20data-autoaffiliated%3D%5C%22false%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Epastry%20school%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20France%2C%20I've%20learned%20the%20secrets%20to%20creating%20the%20perfect%20desserts.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EI%20often%20see%20home%20bakers%20make%20the%20same%20mistakes%2C%20like%20using%20expired%20leaveners%20or%20crowding%20the%20oven.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOther%20common%20mistakes%20include%20overmixing%20the%20batter%20and%20opening%20the%20oven%20too%20frequently.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20a%20full-time%20baker%20who%20has%20attended%20pastry%20school%20in%20France%2C%20completed%20a%20baking%20course%20in%20China%2C%20and%20worked%20in%20several%20bakeries%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmoved-to-new-york-city-biggest-surprises-challenges-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ENew%20York%20City%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20working%20in%20the%20industry%20for%20many%20years%20and%20making%20dozens%20of%20cakes%2C%20croissants%2C%20and%20cookies%2C%20I've%20learned%20the%20secrets%20for%20success%20when%20making%20a%20dessert%20%E2%80%94%20even%20if%20it's%20not%20in%20the%20luxury%20of%20a%20professional%20kitchen.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere%20are%20the%20seven%20most%20common%20mistakes%20I%20see%20from%20home%20bakers%2C%20and%20how%20to%20fix%20them.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EMeasuring%20ingredients%20by%20volume%20instead%20of%20using%20a%20kitchen%20scale%20can%20lead%20to%20inconsistent%20results.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225551%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20person%20using%20a%20pink%20spatula%20to%20measure%20a%20baking%20ingredient%20on%20a%20digital%20kitchen%20scale.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6387b7548c9c486b3103ba%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224163%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ERogerio%20Peccioli%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3ENo%20matter%20what%20I'm%20baking%2C%20I%20avoid%20measuring%20cups%20whenever%20possible%2C%20since%20they're%20not%20very%20precise%20and%20can%20lead%20to%20pastries%20that%20are%20either%20too%20dry%20or%20too%20wet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20volume%20in%20a%20cup%20can%20vary%20depending%20on%20how%20tightly%20the%20ingredient%20is%20packed%2C%20how%20it's%20scooped%2C%20and%20whether%20it's%20leveled%20correctly.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20prevent%20inaccuracies%2C%20I%20like%20to%20use%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcheap-tools-bakers-should-have-according-to-pastry-school-student-2022-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ekitchen%20scale%3C%2Fa%3E%20instead.%20This%20allows%20me%20to%20measure%20out%20the%20exact%20same%20amount%20of%20each%20ingredient%2C%20so%20I%20always%20know%20I'm%20getting%20consistent%20results.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPlus%2C%20I%20find%20it%20makes%20scaling%20recipes%20up%20or%20down%20much%20easier.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20often%20see%20bakers%20make%20adjustments%20to%20a%20recipe%20without%20understanding%20the%20science.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224045%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20variety%20of%20baking%20ingredients%20organized%20in%20separate%20bowls%20and%20containers.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638263ce52cb26b839390c%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223034%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAllison%20Chen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EOnce%20a%20treat%20goes%20into%20the%20oven%2C%20the%20batter%20or%20dough%20triggers%20several%20chemical%20reactions%20before%20it's%20fully%20baked.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESo%2C%20trying%20to%20adjust%20ingredients%20or%20make%20substitutions%20without%20fully%20understanding%20their%20role%20in%20a%20recipe%20might%20drastically%20impact%20the%20taste.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESugar%2C%20for%20example%2C%20does%20much%20more%20than%20add%20sweetness.%20It%20attracts%20and%20retains%20moisture%2C%20helps%20baked%20goods%20brown%2C%20and%20supports%20the%20spread%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcrumbl-vs-insomnia-cookies-which-is-better-2023-8%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etexture%20of%20cookies%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20cakes.%20Reducing%20it%20too%20much%20can%20produce%20a%20dessert%20that%20is%20not%20only%20less%20sweet%20but%20also%20drier%2C%20denser%2C%20paler%2C%20and%20less%20tender.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20reliable%20results%2C%20I%20always%20follow%20the%20recipe%20as%20written%20the%20first%20time.%20And%20whenever%20I%20make%20adjustments%2C%20I%20change%20only%20one%20ingredient%20at%20a%20time%20and%20consider%20its%20effect%20on%20the%20final%20product.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOvermixing%20the%20batter%20can%20lead%20to%20tough%20pastries.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22The%20writer%20holding%20a%20mixing%20bowl%20filled%20with%20thick%20white%20frosting%20and%20a%20red%20spatula.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638303548c9c486b31038f%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EAllison%20Chen%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EI%20find%20that%20many%20home%20bakers%20tend%20to%20overmix%20their%20dough%20or%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcold-stone-creamery-ice-cream-flavors-ranked-worst-to-best%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecake%20batter%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20resulting%20in%20a%20tough%2C%20dense%20texture.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20many%20kinds%20of%20baked%20goods%2C%20I%20think%20it's%20best%20to%20simply%20mix%20until%20combined.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EInstead%20of%20using%20a%20stand%20mixer%2C%20I%20like%20to%20use%20a%20spatula%20and%20mix%20in%20the%20remaining%20dry%20ingredients%20by%20hand.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EUsing%20expired%20baking%20powder%2C%20baking%20soda%2C%20or%20yeast%20is%20a%20recipe%20for%20disaster.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225313%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20person%20adding%20baking%20soda%20to%20a%20glass%20mixing%20bowl%20filled%20with%20other%20dry%20ingredients.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6389f754f98752617796f1%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223985%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ENoko%20LTD%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20baking%20anything%2C%20I%20always%20double-check%20that%20my%20leaveners%20%E2%80%94%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbaking-soda-skin-pros-cons-2023-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ebaking%20soda%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20baking%20powder%2C%20or%20yeast%20%E2%80%94%20are%20not%20expired.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20the%20expiration%20date%20has%20passed%2C%20those%20ingredients%20will%20not%20have%20the%20strength%20to%20make%20a%20cake%20or%20any%20baked%20good%20rise%2C%20resulting%20in%20poor%20texture.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOpening%20the%20oven%20too%20often%20results%20in%20a%20drier%20bake.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%227644%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20person%20opening%20up%20an%20oven%20while%20a%20sheet%20of%20cookies%20are%20baking.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638ad454f9875261779702%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%225733%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EOscar%20Wong%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIf%20I%20ever%20open%20the%20oven%20door%20while%20something%20is%20baking%2C%20heat%20will%20inevitably%20escape%2C%20lowering%20the%20temperature%2C%20extending%20the%20baking%20time%2C%20and%20potentially%20causing%20the%20pastry%20or%20cake%20to%20lose%20moisture.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOpening%20the%20door%20too%20early%20can%20be%20especially%20damaging%20to%20delicate%20bakes%20like%20cakes%2C%20souffl%C3%A9s%2C%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fleft-google-job-pastry-school-france-disney-cruise-chef-2026-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Echoux%20pastry%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20since%20the%20sudden%20temperature%20change%20can%20interrupt%20the%20rising%20process%20and%20cause%20them%20to%20sink%20or%20collapse.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAs%20tempting%20as%20it%20is%20to%20peek%2C%20I%20always%20keep%20the%20oven%20door%20closed%20for%20at%20least%20the%20first%20two-thirds%20of%20the%20recommended%20baking%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhenever%20I%20need%20to%20check%20the%20progress%2C%20I'll%20use%20the%20oven%20light%20and%20watch%20through%20the%20window%2C%20then%20open%20the%20door%20only%20when%20I'm%20ready%20to%20rotate%20the%20pan%20or%20test%20for%20doneness.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EOvercrowding%20the%20oven%20with%20multiple%20pans%20prevents%20desserts%20from%20baking%20evenly.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225203%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Several%20aluminum%20pans%20of%20baked%20goods%20sit%20on%20racks%20inside%20a%20lit%20oven.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638db754f9875261779729%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223902%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3ENoppawat%20Tom%20Charoensinphon%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAdding%20too%20many%20pans%20to%20an%20oven%20can%20affect%20the%20cook%20time%2C%20as%20each%20pan%20absorbs%20heat%20from%20the%20other%2C%20leading%20to%20uneven%20baking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20prevent%20this%2C%20I%20recommend%20using%20the%20convection%20setting%20to%20circulate%20heat%20more%20evenly%2C%20or%20rotating%20pans%20between%20the%20upper%20and%20lower%20racks%20while%20baking.%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3EI%20never%20like%20to%20leave%20the%20dishes%20to%20the%20end.%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225786%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20woman%20rinsing%20a%20metal%20baking%20bowl%20in%20the%20sink.%5C%22%20charset%3D%5C%22%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a638e56548c9c486b31040a%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224340%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3E%3Cp%3EMaria%20Korneeva%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBaking%20often%20requires%20a%20lot%20of%20bowls%20and%20dishes%20for%20each%20step%2C%20but%20allowing%20them%20to%20pile%20up%20can%20make%20the%20process%20feel%20overwhelming.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20my%20pastries%20are%20in%20the%20oven%20or%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcookie-baking-mistakes-people-make-2019-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%