0important%20ways.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHere's%20exactly%20where%20our%20money%20went.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2267e5593a-505d-4cbe-af29-246928cdd2da%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EFlying%20instead%20of%20driving%20saved%20us%20two%20vacation%20days%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20first%20major%20decision%20was%20how%20to%20get%20from%20Cleveland%20to%20Orlando.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20spent%20%241%2C451%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Freview-flying-frontier-first-time-better-than-expected-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EFrontier%20Airlines%3C%2Fa%3E%20flights%20for%20our%20family%20of%20five.%20We%20could%20have%20driven%2C%20but%20the%20trip%20would%20have%20taken%20about%2015.5%20hours%20each%20way.%20That%20would%20have%20meant%20losing%20two%20full%20days%20of%20vacation%20time%20just%20to%20sit%20in%20the%20car.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20us%2C%20flying%20was%20worth%20the%20extra%20cost%20because%20we%20wanted%20to%20make%20the%20most%20of%20our%20time%20in%20the%20parks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20spent%20%2484%20to%20park%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcleveland-airport-wedding-ron-peterson-and-michelle-belleau-2019-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3ECleveland%20Hopkins%20Airport%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20six%20days.%20We%20also%20decided%20not%20to%20rent%20a%20car%20in%20Orlando%20and%20instead%20used%20Uber%20to%20get%20around%20when%20necessary.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e5cd82d9-f54e-4932-b427-e622b8ff1aaf%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20spent%20nearly%20%245%2C000%20on%20Universal%20hotels%20and%20park%20tickets%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20biggest%20expense%20was%20%244%2C948%20for%20our%20Universal%20hotel%20stay%20and%20four-day%20park-to-park%20tickets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20stayed%20at%20Universal's%20Terra%20Luna%20Resort%2C%20one%20of%20the%20newest%20on-site%20hotels.%20Terra%20Luna%20is%20considered%20a%20Prime%20Value%20hotel%2C%20and%20it%20shares%20a%20space-themed%20design%20with%20its%20sister%20property%2C%20Stella%20Nova.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20hotel's%20biggest%20advantage%20is%20its%20location.%20Since%20we%20wanted%20to%20spend%20a%20lot%20of%20time%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fepic-universe-orlando-family-trip-tips-what-worked-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EEpic%20Universe%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20staying%20close%20to%20that%20park%20was%20important.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETerra%20Luna%20guests%20receive%20early%20park%20admission%2C%20which%20allows%20us%20to%20enter%20Epic%20Universe%20one%20hour%20before%20regular%20guests%20each%20day.%20The%20complimentary%20shuttle%20ride%20got%20us%20to%20Epic%20in%20less%20than%20five%20minutes%2C%20and%20buses%20arrived%20frequently.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%224892208a-e814-4ca6-9a99-ad00efd0e502%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EBooking%20two%20rooms%20was%20worth%20the%20extra%20cost%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20challenge%20with%20Terra%20Luna%20is%20that%20the%20hotel%20offers%20only%20standard%20rooms%20that%20accommodate%20up%20to%20four%20people%2C%20so%20our%20party%20of%20five%20needed%20to%20book%20two%20rooms.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAt%20first%2C%20paying%20for%20two%20rooms%20seemed%20like%20a%20big%20expense%2C%20but%20it%20turned%20out%20to%20be%20one%20of%20the%20best%20decisions%20we%20made.%20We%20had%20extra%20space%2C%20privacy%2C%20and%20connecting%20rooms%20so%20we%20could%20still%20easily%20spend%20time%20together.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%221d6692ee-76cd-471c-a236-16eb057049f3%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20skipped%20Express%20Pass%20and%20still%20rode%20everything%20at%20Epic%20Universe%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20four-day%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-family-of-4-spends-day-at-universal-orlando-2023%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epark-to-park%20tickets%3C%2Fa%3E%20included%20Epic%20Universe%2C%20Universal%20Studios%20Florida%2C%20and%20Islands%20of%20Adventure.%20%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20the%20trip%2C%20we%20considered%20buying%20Express%20Passes%20to%20skip%20the%20lines%20at%20Epic%2C%20but%20we%20were%20able%20to%20experience%20everything%20without%20spending%20the%20extra%20money.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHaving%20four%20days%20gave%20us%20the%20flexibility%20to%20wait%20for%20the%20best%20times%20to%20ride%20each%20attraction.%20We%20ended%20up%20riding%20every%20ride%20at%20Epic%20Universe%2C%20and%20the%20longest%20wait%20we%20had%20was%2045%20minutes.%20That%20was%20during%20July%2C%20one%20of%20the%20busiest%20vacation%20periods%20of%20the%20year.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2286336992-e540-489d-9f2d-5bc085ee0cfb%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EOur%20Disney%20day%20cost%20nearly%20%241%2C200%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20added%20one%20day%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-hollywood-studios-attractions-ranking-2022-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDisney's%20Hollywood%20Studios%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20%24926%20in%20tickets.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Four%20park%20visitors%20pose%20on%20a%20palm-lined%20Disney%20street%20with%20Art%20Deco%20storefronts%20and%20a%20stormy%20evening%20sky.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a6249aace52cb26b8393211%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author's%20family%20spent%20most%20of%20their%20family%20trip%20at%20Universal%20Studios%20in%20Orlando%2C%20but%20took%20one%20day%20in%20Disney%20World.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lisa%20Galek%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20we%20only%20had%20one%20day%20at%20Disney%2C%20we%20purchased%20Lightning%20Lane%20passes%20for%20%24250.%20The%20passes%20allowed%20us%20to%20reserve%20a%20time%20for%20Rise%20of%20the%20Resistance%20and%20schedule%20times%20for%20up%20to%20three%20other%20attractions%20throughout%20the%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20strategy%20worked%20well.%20We%20rode%20almost%20everything%20we%20wanted%20except%20Slinky%20Dog%20Dash%2C%20which%20was%20delayed%20during%20our%20reserved%20time%20and%20never%20reopened%20that%20day.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%228b8f6d3a-7cc0-4971-8572-33e360e0ad81%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20spent%20%24767%20on%20food%2C%20but%20still%20found%20ways%20to%20save%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFood%20is%20one%20area%20where%20we%20decided%20not%20to%20cut%20back.%20Part%20of%20the%20fun%20of%20going%20to%20Universal%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fdisney-parks-boom-price-hikes-iran-war-disneyland-international-visits-2026-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EDisney%20parks%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20trying%20the%20themed%20meals%20and%20snacks.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20spent%20%24767%20on%20food%20and%20drinks%2C%20eating%20at%20restaurants%20including%20Cowfish%2C%20Toadstool%20Cafe%2C%20The%20Three%20Broomsticks%2C%20Sci-Fi%20Dine-In%20Theater%2C%20Krusty%20Burger%2C%20Lard%20Lad%2C%20Caf%C3%A9%20L'air%20De%20La%20Sir%C3%A8ne%2C%20and%20Le%20Gobelet%20Noir.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20trick%20we%20used%20was%20ordering%20kids'%20meals%20when%20they%20made%20sense.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d6b7c26e-3f93-4ff0-aaea-b88563b086dd%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EWe%20kept%20souvenir%20spending%20low%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20it%20came%20to%20souvenirs%2C%20we%20spent%20only%20%2437%20on%20three%20chocolate%20frogs%20for%20our%20kids.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOur%20children%20saved%20up%20their%20own%20money%20to%20purchase%20the%20souvenirs%20they%20wanted%2C%20including%20shirts%2C%20treats%2C%20and%20stuffed%20animals.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22d363d6f9-aad7-41ef-8cc1-663acb593b0f%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3ECredit%20card%20rewards%20and%20dining%20credits%20saved%20us%20nearly%20%242%2C500%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAlthough%20the%20total%20trip%20cost%20was%20%248%2C620%2C%20we%20received%20%241%2C920%20back%20in%20travel%20reimbursements%20through%20credit%20card%20points.%20Our%20final%20out-of-pocket%20trip%20cost%20was%20around%20%246%2C700.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20special%20booking%20promotion%20also%20helped%20lower%20our%20meal%20costs.%20Each%20of%20our%20two%20hotel%20rooms%20included%20a%20%24300%20Universal%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhotel-layout-changes-room-service-2025-2%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ehotel%20dining%3C%2Fa%3E%20credit%2C%20giving%20us%20%24600%20to%20spend%20on%20meals%20at%20Terra%20Luna.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20dining%20credit%20was%20extremely%20convenient%20and%20kept%20our%20overall%20food%20costs%20down.%20We%20used%20it%20for%20daily%20breakfast%2C%20as%20well%20as%20other%20meals%2C%20snacks%2C%20and%20adult%20beverages%20at%20the%20hotel.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2285317b33-4932-4069-b8c3-6fad1162d93c%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EThe%20trip%20was%20expensive%20%E2%80%94%20but%20worth%20it%20for%20our%20family%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20%248%2C620%20vacation%20is%20a%20big%20expense%2C%20but%20the%20memories%20we%20made%20were%20worth%20every%20penny.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBy%20saving%20where%20we%20could%2C%20using%20rewards%20strategically%2C%20and%20prioritizing%20the%20experiences%20that%20mattered%20most%2C%20we%20were%20able%20to%20enjoy%20the%20Orlando%20trip%20we%20wanted%20without%20overspending%20%E2%80%94%20and%20create%20memories%20our%20family%20will%20cherish%20for%20years.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-family-spent-budget-trip-disney-world-universal-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784980621000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62492c548c9c486b30fc86%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-family-spent-budget-trip-disney-world-universal-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22On%20our%20family%20trip%20to%20Orlando%2C%20we%20spent%20the%20bulk%20of%20