2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22My%20friend%20told%20me%20something%20about%20parenting%20when%20I%20was%20pregnant.%20The%20truth%20didn't%20hit%20me%20until%20my%20son%20went%20to%20camp.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221833%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22the%20author%20sitting%20on%20grass%20in%20the%20sun%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62551ace52cb26b8393285%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221375%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20writes%20about%20the%20emotion%20she%20feels%20when%20she%20picks%20her%20son%20up%20from%20summer%20camp.%3Cp%3ECourtesy%20of%20Lindsay%20Karp%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMy%20friend%20told%20me%20something%20when%20I%20was%20pregnant%20for%20the%20first%20time%20that%20I%20never%20forgot.%20%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EHe%20said%2C%20%26quot%3BHaving%20children%20is%20like%20having%20your%20heart%20walking%20around%20outside%20your%20body.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EThose%20words%20have%20never%20felt%20more%20true%20than%20when%20my%20teen%20is%20at%20sleepaway%20camp.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20I%20became%20pregnant%20for%20the%20first%20time%20over%2015%20years%20ago%2C%20a%20friend%20offered%20me%20words%20I%20never%20forgot%3A%20%26quot%3BHaving%20children%20is%20like%20having%20your%20heart%20walking%20around%20outside%20your%20body.%26quot%3B%20His%20words%20were%20sweet%2C%20but%20I%20didn't%20fully%20understand%20them%20just%20yet.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20my%20son%20was%20born%2C%20those%20words%20came%20to%20life%2C%20but%20as%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fstay-at-home-mom-side-gigs-help-pay-off-debt-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Estay-at-home%20mother%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20he%20wasn't%20yet%20venturing%20beyond%20my%20sight%2C%20so%20I%20knew%20he%20was%20safe%20and%20well%20in%20real%20time.%20We%20had%20another%20baby%20a%20few%20years%20later%2C%20and%20as%20both%20of%20my%20boys%20grew%2C%20these%20words%20returned%20to%20me%20often.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%229030741c-a207-425d-98cc-19b9b2126097%5C%22%3EI%20missed%20my%20son%20in%20a%20whole%20new%20way%20when%20he%20was%20at%20sleepaway%20camp%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20now-15-year-old%20has%20been%20going%20to%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fsleep-away-camp-parents-needed-break-save-money-travel-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esleepaway%20camp%3C%2Fa%3E%20for%20five%20summers.%20At%20drop%20off%2C%20I%20say%20goodbye%20with%20a%20hug%20and%20hang%20onto%20that%20feeling%20of%20having%20him%20in%20my%20arms%20until%20we're%20together%20again.%20My%20husband%20and%20I%20descend%20the%20hill%20in%20our%20car%2C%20a%20piece%20of%20myself%20left%20behind%20in%20the%20mountains.%20For%20four%20weeks%2C%20I%20move%20through%20life%20wondering%20what%20he's%20doing%2C%20whether%20he's%20brushing%20his%20teeth%20and%20eating%20his%20veggies%2C%20and%20if%20he's%20happy%20being%20many%20miles%20from%20home.%20Everywhere%20I%20go%2C%20thoughts%20of%20him%20follow%2C%20a%20reminder%20that%20I%20am%20not%20whole%20without%20him.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFrom%20his%20first%20summer%20when%20the%20dining%20hall%20unexpectedly%20burned%20to%20the%20ground%20on%20day%20three%2C%20making%20national%20news%20and%20igniting%20a%20motherly%20anxiety%20I'd%20never%20known%2C%20all%20the%20way%20to%20this%20summer%20when%20I%20had%20no%20doubt%20he%20would%20love%20every%20moment%2C%20saying%20goodbye%20has%20become%20easier%20with%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20no%20longer%20worry%20if%20he's%20happy%20or%20if%20he%20knows%20how%20to%20pull%20the%20fitted%20sheet%20over%20the%20corners%20of%20his%20bed%2C%20because%20he's%20more%20mature%20now%2C%20and%20camp%20has%20become%20his%20favorite%20place%20on%20Earth.%20But%20while%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparenting-summer-vacation-school-out-kids-camps-finance-childcare-fees%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Edrop-off%20day%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20transformed%2C%20pick-up%20day%20has%20not.%20It's%20still%20just%20as%20magical%20as%20ever.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22e2ed11a0-ed64-4339-9734-b4e88b1097e1%5C%22%3EPick-up%20day%20is%20magical%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EYesterday%2C%20my%20husband%20and%20I%20arrived%20at%20the%20pavilion%20where%20my%20son's%20trunk%20was%20loaded%20into%20our%20car%2C%20and%20as%20we%20drove%20up%20the%20hill%20towards%20the%20cabins%2C%20the%20feeling%20that%20hits%20me%20every%20summer%20on%20pickup%20day%20returned.%20I%20fought%20the%20happy%20tears%20welling%20in%20my%20eyes%20because%20no%20teenager%20wants%20to%20introduce%20his%20friends%20to%20his%20crying%20mother.%20I%20played%20it%20cool%20for%20him%2C%20but%20inside%20I%20was%20glowing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20living%20a%20month%20with%20a%20piece%20of%20my%20heart%20many%20miles%20away%20with%20only%20pictures%20to%20speak%20of%20his%20well-being%20(we%20wrote%20to%20him%2C%20but%20responses%20from%20him%20were%20scarce)%2C%20being%20reunited%20is%20like%20having%20that%20missing%20piece%20of%20myself%20returned.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWe%20parked%20in%20a%20field%20between%20the%20lower%20and%20upper%20camp%20and%20began%20trekking%20toward%20his%20cabin.%20As%20always%2C%20campers%20were%20savoring%20their%20last%20moments%20together%2C%20reminiscing%20about%20occasions%20so%20impactful%20that%20they%20had%20been%20etched%20into%20their%20memories%20for%20a%20lifetime.%20My%20eyes%20wandered%20back%20and%20forth%20from%20cabin%20deck%20to%20cabin%20deck%2C%20anxiously%20searching%20for%20that%20familiar%20face%20I'd%20been%20missing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThen%2C%20there%20he%20was%2C%20the%20absent%20piece%20of%20my%20puzzle.%20It's%20been%20five%20years%20%E2%80%94%20and%20he's%20grown%20so%20much%20%E2%80%94%20but%20somehow%20that%20moment%20of%20reunification%20feels%20like%20the%20first%20time%20he%20ran%20to%20me%20at%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmet-my-group-of-friends-through-my-kids-day-care-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Epreschool%20pickup%3C%2Fa%3E.%20There's%20no%20running%20%E2%80%94%20and%20I'm%20far%20more%20excited%20than%20he%20is%2C%20this%20time%20around%20%E2%80%94%20but%2C%20still%2C%20having%20him%20with%20me%20again%20returns%20me%20to%20my%20equilibrium.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20big%2C%20strong%20teenager%20wrapped%20his%20arms%20around%20me.%20And%20in%20that%20moment%2C%20I%20realized%20there's%20nothing%20better%20than%20hugging%20your%20child%20on%20pickup%20day.%20It%20makes%20every%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftoddler-tantrums-nothing-worked-book-techniques-helped-2026-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etoddler%20tantrum%3C%2Fa%3E%20and%20teenage%20meltdown%20worth%20it.%20That%20hug%20dissolves%20every%20mother-son%20disagreement%2C%20and%20each%20time%20he%20wanted%20me%20at%20a%20distance%20because%20he%20considered%20me%20embarrassing.%20It%20reminds%20both%20of%20us%20that%20no%20matter%20how%20old%20he%20gets%2C%20I%20will%20always%20be%20there%20to%20return%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2259ae2e04-c8d2-4d01-950a-c554296d493c%5C%22%3EThose%20words%20I%20heard%20years%20ago%20ring%20true%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThose%20words%20my%20friend%20said%20to%20me%20before%20my%20son%20was%20born%20were%20precise.%20I%20felt%20them%20the%20day%20I%20left%20him%20at%20preschool%20for%20the%20first%20time%20and%20on%20the%20day%20we%20dropped%20him%20off%20at%20sleepaway%20camp%20for%20his%20first%20summer.%20But%20they%20became%20crystal%20clear%20when%20I%20received%20my%20first%20pickup%20day%20hug.%20My%20heart%2C%20that%20had%20been%20walking%20around%20outside%20my%20body%2C%20finally%20returned%20to%20my%20chest.%20And%20yesterday%20I%20felt%20it%20all%20over%20again.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20son%20is%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fparents-say-teens-tough-love-raising-high-school-kids-2025-10%5C%22%2