ignation.%20He%20praised%20their%20efforts%20for%20bringing%20a%20regime%20down%20to%20its%20knees.%20Dharmendra%20Pradhan%20announced%20his%20resignation%20in%20a%20public%20letter%20on%20X.%20He%20reflected%20on%20his%20commitment%20to%20students%20and%20education%20reforms.%20Celebrations%20followed%20the%20minister's%20resignation%20at%20Delhi's%20Jantar%20Mantar.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22TOI%20Entertainment%20Desk%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A92%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Ukrainian%20troops%20are%20pinning%20their%20hopes%20on%20a%20new%20top%20general%20after%20losing%20their%20star%20defense%20minister%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mykhailo%20Drapatyi%20sits%20in%20the%20Ukrainian%20presidential%20office%20in%20Kyiv.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a601d0854f9875261777fe3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EMykhailo%20Drapatyi%20was%20appointed%20Ukraine's%20new%20commander%20in%20chief%20on%20Tuesday.%3Cp%3EUkrainian%20Presidential%20Press%20Office%20via%20AP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EMykhailo%20Drapatyi%2C%20Ukraine's%20new%20commander%20in%20chief%2C%20is%20one%20of%20the%20war's%20most%20popular%20generals.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETroops%20told%20Business%20Insider%20they%20hope%20he'll%20bring%20changes%20that%20can%20help%20them%20win%20the%20war.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3ETired%20of%20Soviet%20military%20culture%2C%20they're%20asking%20for%20a%20leader%20who's%20pro-tech%20and%20listens%20to%20them.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EAnxious%20after%20the%20shock%20removal%20of%20Ukraine's%20reformist%20defense%20minister%2C%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Ethe%20country's%20front-line%20troops%20say%20that%20they've%20found%20some%20solace%20in%20a%20new%20appointment%20for%20another%20key%20war%20role%20%E2%80%94%20commander%20in%20chief.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUkrainian%20President%20Volodymyr%20Zelenskyy%20appointed%2043-year-old%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-new-top-general-drapatyi-commander-chief-fedorov-flying-bmp-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EBrig.%20Gen.%20Mykhailo%20Drapatyi%3C%2Fa%3E%20as%20the%20country's%20new%20top%20general%20on%20Tuesday.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20many%20in%20Ukraine%2C%20the%20appointment%20is%20a%20monumental%20shift.%20Drapatyi%20is%20replacing%20Oleksandr%20Syrskyi%2C%20an%20older%20general%20who%20joined%20the%20military%20when%20Ukraine%20was%20still%20a%20Soviet%20republic.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESyrskyi%2C%2060%2C%20has%20overseen%20many%20of%20Ukraine's%20victories%20since%20early%202024%20but%20has%20been%20widely%20accused%20of%20resisting%20change%20and%20sticking%20to%20a%20slower%2C%20top-down%20command%20style%20that%20can%20cost%20lives%20in%20battle.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EUkrainian%20troops%20across%20the%20front%20lines%20celebrated%20Drapatyi's%20new%20appointment%2C%20telling%20Business%20Insider%20they%20anticipate%20the%20young%20general%20to%20quickly%20bring%20much-needed%20reforms%20that%20could%20turn%20the%20tide%20of%20the%20war%20in%20their%20favor.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20Ukrainian%20uncrewed%20ground%20vehicle%20operator%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20while%20he%20feels%20that%20Syrskyi%20has%20%26quot%3Bundoubtedly%20entered%20the%20history%20of%20Ukraine%20as%20the%20general%20who%20stopped%20the%20Russian%20offensive%20at%20the%20most%20difficult%20moment%20for%20the%20state%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20has%20sincere%20hope%20%26quot%3Bthat%20General%20Mykhailo%20Drapatyi%20will%20go%20down%20in%20history%20as%20the%20general%20who%20won%20a%20victory%20over%20Russia.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMany%20see%20Drapatyi%2C%20who's%20had%20a%20string%20of%20high-profile%20victories%20and%20a%20reputation%20for%20stabilizing%20warzones%20under%20Russian%20pressure%2C%20as%20the%20ideal%20working%20partner%20for%20Mykhailo%20Fedorov%2C%20who%20was%20defense%20minister%20until%20recently.%20Both%20are%20seen%20as%20drivers%20of%20radical%20change%20in%20a%20military%20structure%20that%20has%20dysfunctionally%20struggled%20to%20fully%20leverage%20innovation%20and%20exploit%20Russia's%20weaknesses.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Khmara%2C%20Syrskyi%2C%20Zelenskyy%2C%20and%20Drapatyi%20stand%20together%20in%20the%20presidential%20office.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62f528ce52cb26b8393538%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EDrapatyi%2C%20pictured%20on%20the%20far%20right%2C%20is%20replacing%20Syrskyi%2C%20pictured%20second%20from%20the%20left.%3Cp%3EUkrainian%20Presidential%20Press%20Office%20via%20AP%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BHe%20knows%20how%20to%20listen%20and%20keeps%20his%20word%2C%20even%20when%20it%20comes%20to%20small%20promises%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Fizruk%2C%20until%20recently%20a%20strike%20drone%20company%20commander%20with%20the%2082nd%20Air%20Assault%20Brigade.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20major%2C%20identified%20only%20by%20his%20call%20sign%20for%20security%20purposes%2C%20said%20his%20former%20drone%20unit%20fought%20under%20Drapatyi%20when%20the%20latter%20oversaw%20operations%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frussia-sending-troops-zero-experience-key-part-front-vovchansk-ukraine-2024-9%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EVovchansk%2C%20a%20city%20in%20Kharkiv%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Russia%20launched%20a%20major%20offensive%20there%20in%20May%202024%2C%20and%20Drapatyi%20was%20sent%20to%20stabilize%20the%20northeastern%20front.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFizruk%20said%20Drapatyi%20planned%20and%20executed%20operations%20%26quot%3Bmethodically%20and%20effectively%2C%26quot%3B%20but%20was%20also%20personable.%20He%20remembered%20how%20the%20brigadier%20general%20would%20wear%20a%20green%20Ukrainian%20Armed%20Forces%20T-shirt%20to%20fit%20in%20with%20the%20team.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20do%20have%20his%20phone%20number%2C%26quot%3B%20Fizruk%20added.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOther%20Ukrainian%20troops%20praised%20Drapatyi%20for%20his%20track%20record%20and%20openness%20on%20tech%20innovation.%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fhow-telegram-became-the-heart-of-the-ukraine-conflict-2022-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ESocial%20media%3C%2Fa%3E%20has%20allowed%20Kyiv's%20forces%20to%20tune%20in%20closely%20to%20public%20discourse%20about%20the%20war%2C%20even%20while%20they're%20deployed%2C%20as%20civilians%20and%20soldiers%20alike%20share%20daily%20news%2C%20feedback%2C%20commentary%2C%20and%20scandal.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22A%20Ukrainian%20soldier%20scrolls%20through%20videos%20on%20his%20phone%20inside%20a%20bunker.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62f774548c9c486b30ffbf%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224000%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EA%20serviceman%20checks%20his%20phone%20during%20a%20break%20while%20performing%20combat%20tasks%20in%20the%20Kharkiv%20direction%20in%20Ukraine.%3Cp%3EViacheslav%20Madiievskyi%2FUkrinform%2FNurPhoto%20via%20Getty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20commander%20of%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukrainian-operators-dont-need-new-war-robots-want-more-services-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUGV%20unit%3C%2Fa%3E%20in%20the%202nd%20%26quot%3BKhartia%26quot%3B%20Corps%2C%20who%20goes%20by%20the%20call%20sign%20Mathematician%2C%20said%20Drapatyi%20was%20%26quot%3Bmaybe%20the%20best%20choice%26quot%3B%20to%20replace%20Syrskyi.%20He%20described%20the%20new%20commander%20in%20chief%20as%20forward-thinking%20in%20the%20use%20of%20ground%20robots.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAndriy%2C%20an%20enlisted%20soldier%20who%20runs%20community%20engagement%20for%20the%20100th%20Mechanized%20Brigade's%20VORON%20combat%20drone%20unit%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider%20that%20he%20expected%20Drapatyi%20to%20employ%20a%20%26quot%3Bmore%20rational%20approach%20in%20the%20use%20of%20personnel%2C%26quot%3B%20while%20Alex%2C%20an%20officer%20in%20Ukraine's%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraines-soldiers-can-free-hunt-russian-areas-with-new-drones-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EUnmanned%20Systems%20Forces%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20described%20Drapatyi%20as%20a%20commander%20who%20is%20willing%20to%20see%20different%20perspectives%20but%20with%20%26quot%3Breal%20combat%20experience.%26quot%3B%20He%20said%20troops%20respect%20his%20%26quot%3Bvision%20and%20soft%20skills%2C%26quot%3B%20predicting%20a%20morale%20boost.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20UGV%20operator%20who%20spoke%20to%20Business%20Insider%20about%20his%20hopes%20for%20victory%20over%20Russia%20under%20Drapatyi's%20command%20said%20that%20%26quot%3Bif%20the%20new%20leadership%20can%20make%20the%20system%20more%20flexible%2C%20technological%2C%20and%20able%20to%20quickly%20implement%20effective%20solutions%20from%20the%20battlefield%2C%20this%20will%20be%20the%20main%20criterion%20for%20success.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EHe%20said%20it's%20%26quot%3Btoo%20early%20to%20assess%20this%20appointment%20through%20the%20prism%20of%20expectations.%20The%20war%20has%20long%20shown%20that%20it%20is%20not%20individual%20personalities%20that%20are%20decisive%2C%20but%20the%20ability%20of%20the%20military%20system%20to%20quickly%20adapt%20to%20new%20challenges.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EToday%2C%20he%20said%2C%20%26quot%3Bthe%20key%20priorities%20should%20be%20to%20accelerate%20the%20introduction%20of%20innovations%2C%20shorten%20the%20path%20from%20combat%20experience%20to%20real%20changes%20in%20the%20troops%2C%20scale%20up%20unmanned%20and%20robotic%20systems%2C%20and%20provide%20commanders%20in%20the%20field%20with%20greater%20freedom%20to%20make%20quick%20decisions.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BUkraine%20has%20accumulated%20unique%20combat%20experience%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20%26quot%3BOur%20main%20advantage%20should%20be%20the%20ability%20to%20learn%2C%20adapt%2C%20and%20scale%20successful%20solutions%20faster%20than%20the%20enemy.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22f953fed7-93a1-4a81-9df6-0112f2171de6%5C%22%3E'The%20dream%20team'%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EA%20key%20trigger%20for%20Drapatyi's%20appointment%20was%20Fedorov's%20ousting.%20The%20latter%20had%20been%20mired%20in%20a%20rivalry%20with%20Syrskyi%20and%20other%20generals%20in%20Ukraine's%20top%20brass%2C%20whom%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-ousted-defense-minister-says-proposed-changes-hit-resistance-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFedorov%20said%20balked%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20his%20aggressive%20reforms%20and%20campaigns%20to%20root%20out%20corruption%20after%20he%20was%20given%20the%20post%20in%20January.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESyrskyi%20has%20publicly%20denied%20a%20rift%20between%20him%20and%20Fedorov.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fukraine-pro-tech-defense-minister-out-troops-fear-victory-russia-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EFedorov%20was%20left%20out%3C%2Fa%3E%20of%20Zelenskyy's%20cabinet%20last%20week%20in%20a%20government%20reshuffle%2C%20thousands%20took%20to%20the%20streets%20of%20Kyiv%20and%20other%20major%20cities%20to%20protest.%20Support%20for%20Fedorov%20seized%20online%20discourse%20about%20the%20war%2C%20and%20a%20prevailing%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3Edemand%20among%20demonstrators%20was%20that%20Syrskyi%20be%20fired%20instead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225901%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Hundreds%20gather%20in%20Kyiv%20with%20cardboard%20signs.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62f5cace52cb26b8393539%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223930%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EPeople%20gathered%20in%20Kyiv%20to%20denounce%20the%20decision%20to%20dismiss%20Defense%20Minister%20Mykhailo%20Fedorov%20after%20six%20months%20in%20the%20post.%3Cp%3EAP%20Photo%2FDan%20Bashakov%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAlmost%20immediately%2C%20Drapatyi's%20name%20surged%20to%20the%20top%20as%20the%20pick%20for%20Syrskyi's%20replacement.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThere%20is%20a%20consensus%20in%20the%20military%20that%20he%20is%20the%20best%20possible%20candidate%20for%20the%20role%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Dmytro%20Koziatynskyi%2C%20a%20former%20medic%20in%20the%20Da%20Vinci%20Wolves%20who%20called%20for%20civilians%20to%20protest%20last%20week.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EOne%20of%20Drapatyi's%20best-known%20feats%20was%20videoed%20just%20after%20Russia%20invaded%20Crimea%20in%202014.%20At%20the%20head%20of%20an%20armored%20column%2C%20Drapatyi%20ordered%20the%20driver%20of%20his%20infantry%20fighting%20vehicle%20to%20hurtle%20over%20a%20barricade%20in%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmariupol-ukraine-soldiers-injured-killed-russian-captivity-2023-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EMariupol%20and%20into%20battle%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20a%20sign%20of%20decisive%20aggression%20at%20a%20time%20when%20Ukraine's%20military%20was%20still%20finding%20its%20bearings.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%20data-script%3D%5C%22%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fembed.js%5C%22%20data-styles%3D%5C%22default-width%5C%22%20data-embed-type%3D%5C%22custom%5C%22%20data-type%3D%5C%22embed%5C%22%3E%3Cblockquote%20data-instgrm-version%3D%5C%2214%5C%22%20data-instgrm-permalink%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDbEgIwgOuRh%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26amp%3Butm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Freel%2FDbEgIwgOuRh%2F%3Futm_source%3Dig_embed%26utm_campaign%3Dloading%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%20%3Cdiv%3EView%20this%20post%20on%20Instagram%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3Cdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%20%