0return%20as%20defense%20minister.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%226377%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Mykhailo%20Fedorov%20holds%20a%20mic%20at%20a%20press%20briefing.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62f60a54f98752617792e5%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224247%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EFedorov%20spoke%20to%20journalists%20in%20a%20press%20briefing%20just%20after%20his%20ousting%2C%20in%20which%20he%20highlighted%20some%20of%20the%20challenges%20he%20faced%20as%20defense%20minister.%3Cp%3EAP%20Photo%2FDan%20Bashakov%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EMykola%20Bielieskov%2C%20a%20researcher%20for%20Ukraine's%20National%20Institute%20for%20Strategic%20Studies%20and%20the%20war%20crowdfunding%20organization%20Come%20Back%20Alive%2C%20said%20the%20main%20question%20for%20Drapatyi%20now%20is%20who%20he'd%20be%20working%20with%20%E2%80%94%20most%20importantly%2C%20the%20chief%20of%20general%20staff%20and%20defense%20minister.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESeveral%20troops%20told%20Business%20Insider%20are%20still%20hoping%20for%20a%20Drapatyi-Fedorov%20team-up.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BIf%20Fedorov%20returns%2C%20it%20will%20be%20better%2C%20because%20during%20his%20tenure%2C%20we%20saw%20many%20effective%20changes%20in%20the%20military%2C%26quot%3B%20said%20Andriy%20of%20the%20100th%20Mechanized%20Brigade.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAn%20officer%20in%20the%2068th%20Separate%20Jaeger%20Brigade%2C%20who%20goes%20by%20the%20call%20sign%20Fierce%2C%20said%20that%20the%20pair%2C%20as%20the%20top%20leaders%2C%20would%20%26quot%3Bgive%20strength%20to%20the%20Armed%20Forces%20of%20Ukraine%20and%20restore%20Ukrainians'%20faith.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%222dc58fa4-5804-4b26-bbe4-33c0ed7285b8%5C%22%3E'Far%20more%20difficult%20than%20he%20imagines'%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EDrapatyi%20already%20had%20experience%20in%20strategic%20command%2C%20having%20served%20stints%20as%20the%20leader%20of%20Ukraine's%20Ground%20Forces%20and%20then%20its%20Joint%20Forces%20Command.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fvalerii-zaluzhnyi-iron-general-putin-ukraine-war-russia-2023-1%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3EValerii%20Zaluzhnyi%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20Ukraine's%20commander%20in%20chief%20during%20the%20war's%20early%20years%20before%20Syrskyi%20was%20appointed%2C%20praised%20Drapatyi%20in%20a%20Telegram%20post%20on%20Thursday%20but%20warned%20of%20the%20challenges%20ahead.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BThe%20new%20commander%20in%20chief%20of%20Ukraine's%20Armed%20Forces%20will%20have%20an%20incredibly%20difficult%20job.%20Far%20more%20difficult%20than%20he%20imagines%2C%26quot%3B%20Zaluzhnyi%20wrote.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222000%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Zelenskyy%20and%20Zaluzhnyi%20shake%20hands.%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a62f656ce52cb26b839353b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221333%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EZaluzhnyi%20was%20replaced%20by%20Syrskyi%20in%20February%202024.%3Cp%3EUkrainian%20Presidential%20Press%20Office%20via%20AP%2C%20File%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EDrapatyi%20will%20be%20inheriting%20a%20slew%20of%20core%20issues%20for%20Ukraine.%20One%20of%20the%20most%20pressing%20problems%20is%20Kyiv's%20struggle%20to%20recruit%20new%20soldiers%2C%20while%20its%20outnumbered%2C%20deployed%20forces%20are%20exhausted%20by%20years%20of%20fighting.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BNo%20matter%20popularity%2C%20management%20of%20the%20war%20would%20be%20a%20challenge%2C%20given%20manpower%20problems%2C%20unfinished%20corps%20reforms%2C%20and%20a%20deficit%20of%20skilled%20people%20at%20different%20levels%2C%26quot%3B%20Bielieskov%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EFierce%2C%20the%2068th%20Separate%20Jaeger%20Brigade%20officer%2C%20said%20he%20considered%20Drapatyi%20a%20%26quot%3Bstrong%20general%20with%20great%20authority.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BBut%20we'll%20see%20how%20he%20performs%20in%20practice%2C%26quot%3B%20he%20said.%20'It%20seems%