ds%20is%20more%20important.%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%225837%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22father%20working%20from%20home%20and%20spending%20time%20with%20his%20kids%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a611435ce52cb26b8392932%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%224378%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EThe%20author%20(not%20pictured)%20works%20remotely%20and%20has%20a%20four-day%20workweek%2C%20which%20allows%20him%20to%20spend%20more%20time%20with%20his%20family.%3Cp%3Ehobo_018%2FGetty%20Images%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3EI've%20turned%20down%20opportunities%20in%20my%20company%20for%20a%20four-day%20workweek.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EOn%20the%20side%2C%20I've%20built%20a%20freelance%20career.%20Doing%20this%20has%20allowed%20me%20to%20spend%20time%20with%20my%20kids.%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3EPeople%20at%20my%20company%20don't%20understand%2C%20but%20it's%20what's%20right%20for%20me.%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20my%20wife%20and%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffamily-moved-small-town-hard-make-friends-adult-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emoved%20from%20Calgary%20to%20Nelson%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20British%20Columbia%2C%20in%202017%2C%20we%20were%20mostly%20thinking%20about%20our%20kids.%20We%20wanted%20them%20to%20have%20space%2C%20freedom%2C%20and%20a%20childhood%20spent%20outdoors%20in%20nature%20rather%20than%20in%20a%20car%20seat%20during%20rush%20hour.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhat%20I%20didn't%20think%20much%20about%2C%20though%2C%20was%20what%20the%20move%20would%20do%20to%20my%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20we%20moved%2C%20I%20was%20fortunate%20enough%20to%20keep%20my%20corporate%20job%20and%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fmother-negotiated-to-work-from-home-mistake-now-planning-rto-2025-4%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Ego%20fully%20remote%3C%2Fa%3E.%20Over%20the%20years%20that%20followed%2C%20I%20made%20a%20series%20of%20choices%20that%2C%20from%20the%20outside%2C%20probably%20look%20like%20a%20career%20stalling%20out.%20Instead%20of%20working%20long%20hours%20in%20an%20office%20in%20a%20downtown%20high-rise%2C%20I%20work%20four%20days%20a%20week%20from%20our%20spare%20bedroom%20in%20a%20small%20town%20of%2011%2C000%20people.%20And%20I've%20turned%20down%20multiple%20opportunities%20to%20step%20into%20a%20lead%20role%20within%20my%20company.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENone%20of%20that%20happened%20by%20accident.%20Every%20part%20of%20it%20was%20deliberate%2C%20and%20I'd%20make%20the%20same%20choices%20again.%20But%20I've%20learned%20that%20when%20you%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcareerist-corporate-ladder-decline-promotions-work-ethic-american-dream-2024-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Eopt%20out%20of%20the%20ladder%3C%2Fa%3E%20on%20purpose%2C%20the%20people%20around%20you%20struggle%20to%20read%20it%20as%20a%20decision.%20They%20read%20it%20as%20a%20problem.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cd6cb899-485a-4547-870e-93cca654a9ac%5C%22%3EPeople%20assume%20I'm%20waiting%20for%20something%20better%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EColleagues%2C%20friends%2C%20and%20family%20members%20will%20often%20ask%20me%20how%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwhat-ever-happened-to-the-four-day-workweek-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Efour-day%20thing%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20%26quot%3Bworking%20out%2C%26quot%3B%20in%20the%20same%20tone%20you'd%20use%20to%20ask%20about%20a%20medical%20treatment.%20Nobody%20has%20ever%20said%20%26quot%3B%3Cem%3Eyou're%20wasting%20your%20potential%3C%2Fem%3E%26quot%3B%20out%20loud%2C%20but%20the%20assumption%20is%20right%20there%20underneath%20the%20conversation%3A%20that%20I'm%20stuck%20in%20a%20holding%20pattern%2C%20that%20this%20is%20temporary%2C%20that%20eventually%20I'll%20get%20serious%20about%20my%20career.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20truth%20is%2C%20I%20already%20did%20get%20serious.%20I%20just%20got%20serious%20about%20something%20else.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20take%20Fridays%20off%20to%20homeschool%20and%20spend%20time%20with%20my%20kids.%20I%20get%20to%20drop%20off%20and%20pick%20them%20up%20from%20school.%20I%20coach%20their%20soccer%20teams.%20And%20I've%20built%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffreelance-writer-failed-went-back-full-time-job-2023-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esecond%20career%20as%20a%20freelance%20writer%3C%2Fa%3E%20that%20exists%20entirely%20in%20the%20hours%20a%20promotion%20would%20have%20taken.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWhile%20this%20picture%20may%20not%20look%20like%20career%20ambition%20from%20the%20outside%2C%20it's%20the%20most%20ambitious%20thing%20I've%20ever%20done.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22cbe97ff8-c758-4bf9-89a6-3c38fcd4d018%5C%22%3EThe%20trade-off%20is%20real%2C%20and%20I%20made%20it%20anyway%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EI%20want%20to%20be%20honest%20about%20what%20this%20costs%2C%20because%20I%20don't%20think%20choosing%20time%20over%20a%20job%20title%20is%20free.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcharts-show-how-highest-lowest-earners-spend-money-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Emake%20less%20money%3C%2Fa%3E%20than%20I%20would%20in%20a%20lead%20role.%20Which%20can%20be%20stressful%20at%20times%2C%20considering%20I%20have%20a%20mortgage%20and%20two%20kids.%20I%20feel%20that%20math%20every%20month.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI've%20also%20given%20up%20a%20kind%20of%20professional%20standing.%20In%20meetings%2C%20I'm%20not%20the%20go-to%20person%20the%20room%20turns%20to.%20Decisions%20get%20made%20in%20conversations%20I'm%20not%20in.%20Some%20of%20the%20work%20I'd%20be%20genuinely%20good%20at%20goes%20to%20other%20people%2C%20and%20occasionally%20that%20stings%20more%20than%20I%20expect%20it%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EAnd%20I've%20noticed%20the%20cost%20of%20being%20on%20a%20non-management%20track%20for%20years.%20You%20become%20slightly%20harder%20to%20place%2C%20and%20people%20stop%20thinking%20of%20you%20when%20something%20big%20comes%20up.%20The%20old%20adage%20of%20%26quot%3Bout%20of%20sight%2C%20out%20of%20mind%26quot%3B%20rings%20true%20in%20my%20life.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20here's%20what%20I%20got%20in%20exchange%3A%20I've%20been%20home%20for%20nearly%20every%20school%20pickup%20and%20sick%20day%20my%20kids%20have%20ever%20had.%20I%20was%20there%20for%20the%20years%20when%20my%20daughter%20still%20wanted%20to%20tell%20me%20about%20her%20day%2C%20and%20I'm%20still%20here%20now%20that%20she's%20almost%2012%20and%20doesn't%20always%20want%20to.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI'm%20well%20aware%20that%20window%20of%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwish-i-could-give-child-more-independence-2024-12%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Etime%20in%20my%20kids'%20lives%3C%2Fa%3E%20is%20closing.%20The%20promotion%20will%20still%20be%20there.%20This%20time%20with%20my%20kids%2C%20however%2C%20will%20not.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2242d20cc7-22bb-4775-a05b-5da0643dfc84%5C%22%3EMy%20kids%20don't%20know%20I%20gave%20anything%20up%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20funny%20thing%20is%20that%20the%20people%20this%20decision%20was%20made%20for%20have%20no%20idea%20I%20made%20it.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EMy%20kids%20don't%20know%20that%20I%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fgen-z-rejects-promotions-management-roles-traditional-corporate-ladder-2023-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3Esaid%20no%20to%20a%20promotion%3C%2Fa%3E.%20They%20don't%20know%20there%20was%20a%20version%20of%20my%20life%20with%20a%20bigger%20salary%20and%20less%20of%20me%20in%20it.%20They%20just%20know%20that%20I'm%20always%20around%2C%20that%20I'm%20the%20one%20at%20the%20soccer%20field%20on%20Saturdays%2C%20and%20that%20when%20they%20walk%20in%20the%20door%20after%20school%2C%20someone%20is%20there.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ETo%20them%2C%20that's%20not%20a%20sacrifice.%20It's%20just%20how%20things%20are.%20And%20I've%20come%20to%20understand%20that's%20the%20whole%20point.%20A%20choice%20like%20this%20only%20works%20if%20it's%20invisible%20to%20the%20people%20it's%20for.%20If%20my%20kids%20ever%20had%20to%20be%20grateful%20for%20it%2C%20it%20would%20mean%20I'd%20made%20it%20about%20me.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22bd0cce1f-9a93-4b9b-9228-efb8de8d29a0%5C%22%3EI've%20stopped%20explaining%20myself%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cp%3EFor%20a%20long%20time%2C%20I%20felt%20a%20need%20to%20justify%20the%20four-day%20workweek.%20I'd%20over-explain%2C%20list%20the%20reasons%2C%20and%20make%20sure%20people%20knew%20I%20was%20still%20productive%2C%20ambitious%2C%20and%20valuable%2C%20as%20though%20I%20owed%20the%20world%20an%20explanation.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EI%20don't%20do%20that%20anymore.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EPart%20of%20it%20is%20age.%20I'm%2039%2C%20and%20I've%20spent%20enough%20years%20approaching%20my%20work%20like%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffreelance-career-stable-treat-work-job-hunting-2026-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22_blank%5C%22%3EI'm%20always%20job%20hunting%3C%2Fa%3E%20to%20know%20that%20professional%20security%20is%20mostly%20an%20illusion%20anyway.%20Titles%20disappear.%20Budgets%20shrink.%20Companies%20restructure.%20The%20people%20climbing%20hardest%20are%20not%20necessarily%20any%20safer%20than%20I%20am.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBut%20mostly%2C%20I've%20just%20made%20peace%20with%20being%20illegible%20to%20the%20people%20I%20work%20with.%20They%20see%20a%20career%20that%20plateaued%2C%20while%20I%20see%20a%20life%20I%20built%20on%20purpose%2C%20one%20deliberate%20step%20at%20a%20time.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThey%20don't%20have%20to%20understand%20it.%20It%20was%20never%20for%20them%20anyway.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ffour-day-workweek-family-time-over-promotions-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784977501000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a611435ce52cb26b8392932%