s%20or%20childbirth%3B%20she%20had%20recently%20given%20birth%20to%20her%20son%2C%20Ashton%2C%20who%20weighed%20over%2010%20pounds.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EShe%20also%20increasingly%20felt%20fatigued%2C%20but%20had%20an%20explanation%20for%20that%2C%20too%3A%20she%20was%20a%20registered%20nurse%20at%20the%20University%20of%20Mississippi%20Medical%20Center.%20%26quot%3BI'm%20tired%20all%20the%20time%2C%20but%20I%20can%20justify%20that%2C%20as%20I%20work%2012-hour%20shifts%2C%26quot%3B%20Ramsey%2C%2040%2C%20told%20Business%20Insider.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%222555%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20chemo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd5fe548c9c486b30ebc7%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221917%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%20dismissed%20blood%20in%20her%20stool%2C%20one%20of%20the%20most%20common%20colon%20cancer%20symptoms%2C%20for%20years.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBy%202019%2C%20when%20the%20bleeding%20got%20worse%2C%20she%20scheduled%20an%20appointment%20with%20a%20gastroenterologist.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EDespite%20Ramsey%20only%20being%2033%20at%20the%20time%20and%20having%20no%20known%20family%20history%2C%20her%20GI%20found%20blood%20in%20her%20stool%20%E2%80%94%20one%20of%20the%20most%20common%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Frectal-bleeding-most-common-early-sign-of-colon-cancer-taboo-2025-5%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Esymptoms%20of%20colon%20cancer%3C%2Fa%3E%20%E2%80%94%20too%20concerning%20not%20to%20schedule%20her%20for%20a%20colonoscopy.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EWeeks%20later%2C%20Ramsey%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20stage%203%20colon%20cancer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BI%20kind%20of%20was%20in%20shock%20but%20it%20didn't%20really%20sink%20in%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20She%20called%20Mickee%2C%20her%20then-boyfriend%20(now-husband)%2C%20to%20break%20the%20news.%20%26quot%3BI%20was%20just%20like%2C%20'Okay%2C%20well%2C%20we've%20got%20to%20get%20in%20there%20and%20get%20it%20out%20and%20move%20on.'%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%223a2a11cf-0b76-4b11-a9ef-4a1912c60a15%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EShe%20worked%20throughout%20chemo%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223088%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20chemo%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd46e54f9875261777e80%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222316%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%20working%20during%20her%20chemo%20treatments.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcolon-cancer-symptoms-in-my-30s-colonoscopy-cost-insurance-2025-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ERamsey's%20colonoscopy%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20she%20learned%20she%20had%20a%20polyp%20that%20was%20too%20large%20to%20remove%20during%20the%20procedure.%20She%20was%20scheduled%20for%20an%20appointment%20with%20a%20general%20surgeon%2C%20who%20diagnosed%20her%20with%20colon%20cancer.%20Ramsey%20learned%20that%20the%20cancer%20had%20spread%20to%20her%20lymph%20nodes.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20surgery%2C%20performed%20in%20November%202019%2C%20removed%203%20feet%20of%20Ramsey's%20colon%20and%2013%20lymph%20nodes.%20Before%20she%20could%20start%20her%20next%20phase%20of%20treatment%2C%20Mickee%20%E2%80%94%20who%20was%20friends%20with%20the%20surgeon%20%E2%80%94%20asked%20for%20a%20favor%3A%20could%20they%20postpone%20her%20treatment%20by%20a%20few%20weeks%20so%20he%20could%20trip%20to%20New%20Orleans%3F%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%223024%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20with%20husband%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd3d9548c9c486b30ebac%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%222268%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3EAfter%20Ramsey's%20surgery%2C%20Mickee%20popped%20the%20question%20during%20a%20Saints%20football%20game.%20%26quot%3BIt%20was%20really%20cool%2C%26quot%3B%20Ramsey%20said.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20January%202020%2C%20newly-engaged%3Cstrong%3E%20%3C%2Fstrong%3ERamsey%20began%20two%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fbiggest-cancer-innovations-asco-2025-exercise-as-drug-astra-zeneca-early-treatment-2025-6%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Etypes%20of%20chemotherapy%3C%2Fa%3E%20at%20once%3A%20IV%20and%20oral.%20Ramsey%20continued%20to%20work%20all%20throughout%20chemo.%20At%20that%20point%2C%20she%20was%20a%20branch%20manager%20for%20a%20home%20health%20agency.%20She%20said%20she%20took%20her%20computer%20with%20her%20to%20chemo%20appointments.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EThe%20oral%20chemo%20led%20to%20Ramsey%20developing%20severe%20side%20effects%20and%20losing%2017%20pounds.%20%26quot%3BI%20got%20really%2C%20really%2C%20really%20sick%20because%20of%20that%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20She%20also%20developed%20cold%20sensitivity%20in%20her%20fingers.%20%26quot%3BI%20had%20to%20wear%20gloves%20or%20use%20a%20potholder%20to%20open%20my%20car%20door%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said%2C%20and%20drinking%20cold%20water%20felt%20like%20%26quot%3Bblades%20were%20in%20my%20throat.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERamsey%20said%20her%20son%20and%20her%20recent%20engagement%20helped%20her%20figure%20out%20her%20%26quot%3Bwhy%26quot%3B%20for%20staying%20strong%20during%20treatment.%20%26quot%3BI%20was%20determined%20no%20one%20else%20was%20going%20to%20raise%20my%20little%20boy%20but%20me%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%22ef55f31e-9994-49e6-8d6b-f2d8c821b294%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EA%20surprise%20pregnancy%20months%20after%20treatment%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221785%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20and%20family%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd4e354f9875261777e89%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%221339%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%20unexpectedly%20became%20pregnant%20with%20her%20son%2C%20Emree%2C%20only%20a%20few%20months%20after%20finishing%20her%20chemotherapy%20treatments.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EBefore%20starting%20chemotherapy%2C%20Ramsey%20was%20offered%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fyoung-cancer-fertility-preservation-egg-sperm-freezing-state-laws-2025-11%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Efertility%20preservation%20services%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20as%20chemotherapy%20can%20impair%20fertility.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EBecause%20Ramsey%20and%20Mickee%20were%20in%20a%20blended%20family%20that%20included%20Mickee's%20children%2C%20Ramsey%20declined.%20She%20also%20didn't%20use%20birth%20control.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EA%20few%20months%20after%20finishing%20chemo%20in%20March%202020%2C%20Ramsey%20learned%20she%20was%20pregnant.%20At%20first%2C%20she%20was%20worried%20about%20her%20baby's%20health%3A%20%26quot%3BI'm%20a%20complete%20nervous%20wreck%20that%20I'm%20going%20to%20give%20birth%20to%20a%20little%20baby%20Transformer%20or%20something%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221209%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20wedding%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd549548c9c486b30ebc3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22907%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%20juggled%20planning%20her%20wedding%20and%20her%20pregnancy%20right%20after%20ending%20her%20cancer%20treatment.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EStill%2C%20she%20felt%20comforted%20by%20a%20dream%20she%20had%20before%20her%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Ftrue-cost-young-colon-cancer-crisis-2025-10%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecancer%20diagnosis%3C%2Fa%3E.%20%26quot%3BI'm%20a%20very%20spiritually%20faith-based%20person%2C%20and%20I%20had%20a%20dream%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20%26quot%3BThe%20Lord%20told%20me%20there%20was%20going%20to%20be%20another%20baby%2C%20and%20his%20name%20was%20going%20to%20be%20Luke%20or%20Lucas.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERamsey%20named%20her%20son%20Emree%20Lucas-Ray%20Ramsey.%20She%20said%20his%20name%20means%20%26quot%3B'strong%20ray%20of%20light%2C'%20which%20couldn't%20be%20any%20more%20perfect%20than%20from%20the%20situation%20that%20he%20came%20from.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Ch2%20data-toc-id%3D%5C%2241f6a93c-eb7d-4c2e-8675-641a396d39b2%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3EGenetic%20testing%20helped%20her%20family%20get%20diagnosed%20with%20colon%20cancer%2C%20too%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fh2%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%221030%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20winning%20pageant%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd72fce52cb26b839211b%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%22773%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%2C%20who%20won%20the%202024%20Mrs.%20Mississippi%20Plus%20America%20pageant%2C%20chose%20colon%20cancer%20awareness%20as%20her%20platform.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EAfter%20she%20was%20diagnosed%20with%20colon%20cancer%2C%20Ramsey%20learned%20about%20genetic%20testing%20for%20mutations%20that%20could%20predispose%20one%20to%20cancer.%20Ramsey%20decided%20to%20do%20it%2C%20and%20learned%20she%20had%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Factive-45-year-old-man-diagnosed-colorectal-cancer-lynch-syndrome-2026-7%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3ELynch%20syndrome%3C%2Fa%3E%2C%20a%20symptomless%2C%20inherited%20condition%20that%20increases%20her%20risk%20of%20developing%20colon%2C%20uterine%2C%20and%20ovarian%20cancer.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ENow%20in%20remission%2C%20Ramsey%20gets%20yearly%20colonoscopies%2C%20scans%2C%20and%20bloodwork.%20She%20also%20had%20a%20hysterectomy%20last%20year%2C%20unrelated%20to%20cancer%2C%20that%20she%20said%20makes%20her%20extra%20relieved%20because%20it%20removes%20her%20risk%20of%20developing%20uterine%20and%20ovarian%20cancer%20as%20a%20result%20of%20having%20Lynch%20syndrome.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ESince%20learning%20she%20has%20Lynch%20syndrome%2C%20Ramsey%20begged%20her%20family%20members%20to%20get%20cancer%20screenings.%20%26quot%3BI%20was%20the%20whistleblower%2C%26quot%3B%20she%20said.%20As%20a%20result%2C%20she%20said%20her%20brother%20caught%20his%20colon%20cancer%20at%20stage%201%2C%20her%20father%20now%20has%20a%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-colon-cancer-misdiagnosed-ibs-hemorrhoid-2025-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecolostomy%20bag%3C%2Fa%3E%20from%20his%20own%20colon%20cancer%20treatment%2C%20and%20her%20aunt%20learned%20that%20what%20she%20thought%20were%20gallstones%20were%20masses%20in%20her%20colon%20and%20liver.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cfigure%3E%3Cimg%20width%3D%5C%224284%5C%22%20alt%3D%5C%22Bryce%20Ramsey%20DC%5C%22%20src%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd640548c9c486b30ebcb%3Fformat%3Djpeg%5C%22%20height%3D%5C%223213%5C%22%3E%3Cfigcaption%3ERamsey%20now%20advocates%20for%20greater%20awareness%20around%20colon%20cancer%20and%20screening%20for%20genetic%20conditions%20like%20Lynch%20syndrome.%3Cp%3EBryce%20Ramsey%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Ffigcaption%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%3Cp%3EWhen%20Ramsey's%20sons%20reach%20their%2020s%20%E2%80%94%20the%20recommended%20age%20to%20start%20testing%20for%20Lynch%20syndrome%20%E2%80%94%20she%20hopes%20they'll%20get%20tested%2C%20too.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3ERamsey%2C%20who%20was%20crowned%20Mrs.%20Mississippi%20Plus%20America%20in%202024%2C%20used%20the%20opportunity%20to%20spread%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fcolon-rectal-cancer-rise-young-people-protect-yourself-lower-risk-2026-3%5C%22%20target%3D%5C%22%5C%22%3Ecolon%20cancer%20awareness%20%3C%2Fa%3E%E2%80%94%20something%20she's%20passionate%20about.%20Ramsey%20has%20also%20worked%20with%20several%20advocacy%20groups%20and%20lobbied%20for%20funding%20for%20genetic%20testing.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3E%26quot%3BWhat%20I%20say%20in%20every%20one%20of%20my%20speeches%20is%3A%20'If%20it%20doesn't%20seem%20right%2C%20more%20than%20likely%20it's%20not%2C'%26quot%3B%20Ramsey%20said.%20%26quot%3BWhat's%20scary%20is%20that%2C%20as%20a%20nurse%2C%20I%20still%20wasn't%20fully%20convinced%20this%20might%20be%20cancer.%26quot%3B%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cdiv%3ERead%20the%20original%20article%20on%20%3Ca%20href%3D%5C%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-dismissed-common-colon-cancer-sign-years-diagnosed-stage-3-2026-7%5C%22%3EBusiness%20Insider%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784974561000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.insider.com%2F6a5fd962548c9c486b30ebe3%3Fformat%3Djpeg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.businessinsider.com%2Fwoman-dismissed-common-colon-cancer-sign-years-diagnosed-stage-3-2026-7%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22A%20nurse%20had%20blood%20in%20her%20stool%2C%20a%20common%20colon%20cancer%20symptom%2C%20for%20years.%20She%20was%20diagnosed%20at%20stage%203.%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22jpugachevsky%40businessinsider.com%20(Julia%20Pugachevsky)%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A9%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22%22%2C%22ampUrl%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%7B%22title%22%3A%22Education%20Minister%20Dharmendra%20Pradhan%20resigns%20amid%20nationwide%20protests%22%2C%22content%22%3A%22%22%2C%22published%22%3A1784973132000%2C%22visual%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fbsmedia.business-standard.com%2F_media%2Fbs%2Fimg%2Farticle%2F2026-05%2F15%2Fthumb%2Ffeaturecrop%2F1200X628%2F1778830969-7939.jpg%22%2C%22originID%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Findia-news%2Feducation-minister-dharmendra-pradhan-resigns-amid-nationwide-protests-126072500585_1.html%22%2C%22summary%22%3A%22The%20minister's%20resignation%20comes%20weeks%20after%20protests%20over%20the%20leaking%20of%20the%20question%20paper%20for%20the%20highly-competitive%20National%20Eligibility-cum-Entrance%20Test%20(Neet-UG)%20for%20admissions%20to%20medical%20colle%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22%22%2C%22engagement%22%3A91%2C%22canonicalUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.business-standard.com%2Findia-news%2Feducation-minister-dharmendra-pradhan-resigns-amid-nationwide-protests-126072500585_1.html%22%2C%22cdnAmpUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww-business--standard-com.cdn.ampproject.org